6364223d-ba51-48d8-8ec0-adbd5e526243	542ae133-ad48-4b83-badc-897f2142f8dd	Based on the teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji, a "Beautiful State" is a profound inner condition characterized by:\n\n1. Inner Calm and Peace\nSri Krishnaji describes a beautiful state as a positive condition where you are:\n- Internally calm and peaceful\n- Not engulfed by suffering\n- Able to walk out of negative emotional experiences effortlessly\n\n2. Energetic Qualities\nIn a beautiful state, you:\n- Feel more love and connection\n- Are more present\n- Have greater attention to detail\n- Celebrate life\n- Experience joy and serenity\n\n3. External Impact\nWhen you are in a beautiful state, it doesn't just affect your inner world, but also:\n- Sends positive signals to the "vast fabric of consciousness"\n- Transforms your external environment\n- Attracts more positive experiences\n\n4. Contrast with Suffering State\nUnlike a state of suffering where:\n- You're stuck in sadness, hurt, or disappointment\n- Energy is continuously drained\n- You create from a place of stress\n\nThe beautiful state is about consciously choosing to move beyond suffering and experiencing life from a place of inner peace and joy.\n\n*(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZRQoiRe7s4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VxJWAmiYu_0"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-18 06:47:12+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "fast", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZRQoiRe7s4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VxJWAmiYu_0"], "model_provider": "openrouter", "route_decision": "fast", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/