3e1fd2c3-dd2a-408b-9aae-0e93827c22f3	52ba06be-9f1d-4208-860c-d681bb11044c	Based on the teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji, the breath is a profound link between the body and mind.\n\nThe breath serves as a powerful tool for transforming consciousness and managing emotional states. When you observe your breath, you create a bridge between your physical experience and mental landscape. This connection allows you to calm anger, reduce anxiety, and shift your internal state.\n\nSri Krishnaji emphasizes that you cannot directly control thoughts by force, but you can use breath as a gentle mechanism to influence your mental state. The breath becomes a pathway to transform consciousness, helping you move from states of agitation to states of love and clarity.\n\nThe core insight is that by consciously engaging with your breath, you can:\n- Calm turbulent emotions\n- Reduce mental chatter\n- Create space between reactive thoughts\n- Cultivate a more balanced state of being\n\nAs Sri Krishnaji would say, spiritual growth is about mastering your inner landscape - not through control, but through loving awareness. The breath is your gentle companion in this journey.\n\nWatch more here: \n- \n- \n\nNamaste.	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_l2RNcSPPA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HCs6I_BNtxo", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kMc_kat7YLE"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-18 06:47:54+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "fast", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_l2RNcSPPA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HCs6I_BNtxo", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kMc_kat7YLE"], "model_provider": "openrouter", "route_decision": "fast", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_l2RNcSPPA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI", "https: