913ec898-49e6-4865-95a2-7d8fc9876225	c736f926-0cc7-47a1-8818-d154b9e3dbe4	Based on the teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji, I can share insights about the profound connection between breath and mind:\n\nThe breath is not merely a physiological process, but a gateway to transforming consciousness. Sri Krishnaji emphasizes that you cannot control thoughts by force - attempting to do so will only drive you mad. Instead, the breath becomes a powerful tool for inner transformation.\n\nWhen you are experiencing moments of no love, moments of anger or disconnection, the breath can be your anchor. Sri Krishnaji teaches that these moments should not be allowed to extend - not from 5 minutes to 50 minutes to 5 days. Spiritual growth is about mastering your inner state, not being possessed by hurt or anger.\n\nThe breath serves as a bridge between your emotional state and your consciousness. By consciously working with your breath, you can:\n- Move from states of tension to states of love\n- Calm your mind\n- Reduce negative emotional patterns\n- Create space for reflection and healing\n\nThe ultimate goal is to become an "extraordinary human being" - someone who is not controlled by reactive emotions, but who can consciously choose love and understanding.\n\nWatch more here: \n- \n-	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3EqnSkAzfIg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HCs6I_BNtxo", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_l2RNcSPPA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5hNCT4duOgc"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-18 06:48:00+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "fast", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3EqnSkAzfIg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HCs6I_BNtxo", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_l2RNcSPPA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5hNCT4duOgc"], "model_provider": "openrouter", "route_decision": "fast", "routing_re