89954f38-4d5a-49f7-902a-9e891ca33b6c	d453e9d2-abd3-4a8d-b769-21f13dcca494	Soul Sync is a profound nine-minute meditation practice designed to help individuals progressively relax and expand their consciousness. Here are the key aspects of this meditation:\n\nPurpose:\n- Accessible to both beginners and experienced meditators\n- Aims to relax the body, calm the mind, and expand consciousness\n- Leads to a state of self-transcendence\n\nPractice Components:\n1. Initial Breath Observation\n- Sit erect with hands on thighs, palms facing upwards\n- Touch thumb to different fingertips during 8 complete breaths\n- If mind wanders, gently bring attention back to breath\n\n2. Humming Phase\n- Exhale while making a strong bee-like humming sound\n- Create vibrations in the head\n- Continue touching fingertips with thumb during 8 hums\n\n3. Pause Between Breaths\n- Focus on the minute pause between inhalation and exhalation\n- Bring attention to the transition point\n\nKey Benefits:\n- Progressive relaxation\n- Increased mindfulness\n- Expanded awareness\n- Personal growth tool\n\nSri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji emphasize that this meditation can be practiced by anyone, regardless of economic background, making it a universally accessible spiritual practice.\n\nWatch more here: \n- \n- \n\n*(Teachings referenced: breath awareness, golden light)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OzgA9wYM6Oc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-0O6WmxU3pw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zO8tQkjCpyc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-18 18:00:12+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "fast", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OzgA9wYM6Oc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-0O6WmxU3pw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zO8tQkjCpyc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc"], "model_provider": "openrouter", "route_decision": "fast", "routin