88341e83-c4cf-4e84-bfa5-209bf81afe2f	44dc7496-51f0-4bb5-9951-d1f7fea829cd	నమస్కారం! అంxిటీ నుండి విముక్తి పొందడం అనేది జీవితంలో అత్యంత महत్వపూర్ణ ప్రయాణం. Sri Krishnaji and Sri Preethaji's teachings offer profound insights into emotional liberation:\n\n✦ **Soul Sync Practice**: \n• Inner peace begins with breath awareness\n• Connect with universal intelligence through gentle, conscious breathing\n• Allow golden light to flow through your consciousness\n\n✦ **Consciousness Transformation**:\n• Recognize anxiety as a mental construct, not your true essence\n• Practice pause and observe thoughts without judgment\n• Develop **Serene Mind** technique to release mental suffering\n\n✦ **Spiritual Freedom Strategies**:\n• Cultivate **Beautiful State** through daily meditation\n• Use Deeksha (oneness blessing) to expand neurobiological awareness\n• Align with inner truth beyond ego-driven stress\n\n✦ **Emotional Liberation Approach**:\n• Understand that worry is a temporary mental state\n• Shift from reactive thinking to conscious presence\n• Embrace spiritual vision of inner peace\n\nRemember, liberation is not about eliminating anxiety, but transforming your relationship with it. Your true self is already serene and unbounded.	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o6X1TVEFHAY", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.ekam.org/", "https://www.breathingroom.com/"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-18 18:44:06+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "tier3_complex", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o6X1TVEFHAY"], "low_confidence": true, "model_provider": "openrouter", "relevant_count": 1, "reranked_count": 10, "route_decision": "tier3_complex", "routing_reason": "classifier", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o6X1TVEFHAY", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Se