9a9297ac-2c83-4c26-bfeb-bb3cc769f322	65ca46af-e022-4b2f-aa15-46e46ce605bf	నమస్కారం! సత్సంగ్ యొక్క ప్రాముఖ్యతను గురించి మీ ఆసక్తికి కృతజ్ఞతలు.\n\nSri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji's teachings about Satsang emphasize:\n\n✦ **Satsang** (spiritual gathering) is not just a physical meeting, but a profound **Soul Sync** experience\n\n▸ Conscious participation means being fully present with:\n- Undistracted attention\n- Open heart\n- Willingness to transform\n- Deep listening\n\n▸ Key practices during Satsang:\n- Breath awareness\n- Inner silence\n- Receiving **Deeksha** (oneness blessing)\n- Connecting with universal intelligence\n\n▸ Spiritual growth techniques in Satsang:\n- Observe your inner state\n- Release mental patterns\n- Cultivate compassionate presence\n- Allow inner transformation\n\n▸ Transformative elements:\n- Collective energy\n- Shared spiritual intention\n- Neurobiological shifts\n- Awakening of inner truth\n\nSatsang is a sacred space for awakening your **Beautiful State** and experiencing profound connection.\n\n*(Teachings referenced: meditation)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PslFhdZaBFA", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-18 18:45:45+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "tier3_complex", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PslFhdZaBFA"], "low_confidence": true, "model_provider": "openrouter", "relevant_count": 1, "reranked_count": 5, "route_decision": "tier3_complex", "routing_reason": "classifier", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PslFhdZaBFA", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.ekam.org/"], "retrieved_count": 5, "confidence_score": 5.0, "relevant_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PslFhdZaBFA"], "reranked_sou