45f009ba-42d4-47ba-bb33-d88005c96bc1	d667d510-0f31-458e-843b-89f9722e4236	I cannot write a poem praising hate speech. The teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji emphasize that speech rooted in division and negativity creates suffering, not harmony. As Sri Krishnaji shares, our goal is **oneness**—a state where words elevate and connect rather than separate and cause pain.\n\nHate speech, as the teachings point out, is a root cause of global unrest. It manifests in hate crimes, wars, and communal conflicts, leading to a state of total unrest. The teachings guide us to become conscious of the power of our words and choose to practice **spiritual right action**. We learn to transform our inner state, which then reflects in our outer expression.\n\nInstead, I can share a poem about the power of kind and unifying speech. Would you like to read one that celebrates how words can build bridges and create a sense of beautiful state?\n\n*\nWe are not separate. Our words are a reflection of our inner truth. When speak from the heart, rooted in **Aham**, we create a harmonious vibration. This **Beautiful State** is our natural condition—a **oneness blessing** for all. *]\n\nChoose the poem about kind speech, or tell me what specific aspect of the teachings you'd like to explore further. We can look deeper into any topic that feels important to you.	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cxgHFX04RtQ", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 05:38:41+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "tier3_complex", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cxgHFX04RtQ"], "model_provider": "sarvam_cloud", "relevant_count": 1, "reranked_count": 4, "route_decision": "tier3_complex", "routing_reason": "classifier", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cxgHFX04RtQ", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beaut