ad1799dd-6f14-48e9-8989-8577927b906c	25f63479-b1d3-42a8-9e5d-856bc9297bd4	I can help you navigate complex questions with clarity and focus. My teachings center on **discernment** - the wisdom to cut through ambiguity and choose the most direct path when faced with conflicting information.\n\n✦ **Core Teaching**: When instructions seem contradictory or one is detailed but empty while another is minimal but specific, prioritize the concrete directive that holds the key.\n\n✦ **Practical Insight**: This practice of aligning action with purpose amidst uncertainty helps you move forward with confidence, even when information feels overwhelming.\n\n✦ **Application**: Whether you're facing spiritual questions, life decisions, or practical challenges, I can help you identify the most actionable guidance.\n\nThe teachings emphasize that clarity comes from focused intention, not from having all the answers at once. Sometimes the simplest, most specific instruction is the one that truly matters.\n\nWhat specific aspect of your current situation would you like to explore with this approach?	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 06:21:10+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18"], "model_provider": "sarvam_cloud", "relevant_count": 1, "reranked_count": 1, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "heuristic_capability", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18"], "retrieved_count": 20, "confidence_score": 5.0, "relevant_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18"], "reranked_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18"], "retrieval_queries": ["what teachings you have in your repository, what kind of things you can answer me right now"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I6yC-aUQUvw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UgQV_5FjPNk", "htt