4bb191f7-94e3-409c-98f2-70aaacb331cb	688c3fdc-7523-42b3-ae58-d50f59330c41	Namaste, my dear. It gives me great joy to share the essence of Soul Sync with you.\n\nSoul Sync is a beautiful and powerful meditation practice that Sri Preethaji and I, Sri Krishnaji, created with the sacred intention of awakening people to the mystical dimension of their own consciousness. We designed it to be a master practice, easy for both beginners and seasoned meditators, that progressively leads you to a deeper state of awareness.\n\nIts primary cause, as we say, is Peace. This practice is your strength to dissolve your inner violence, a magic wand to heal your heart and to move on with life, and your gateway to a peaceful life. It is your genie to solve existing challenges and your way to live a life beyond judgment and division.\n\nThe practice itself is a nine-minute journey. We begin by sitting with our eyes closed, holding our spine erect, and taking eight conscious breaths to become centered. In the second stage, we inhale slowly and exhale while making a gentle humming sound, eight times, to create a soothing vibration. Finally, we conclude with the sacred sound, "Om, Om," to seal the practice and open your heart.\n\nThe deeper teaching behind this is that the power to manifest a beautiful life for ourselves and our loved ones comes not from strategy alone, but from the power of our own consciousness. It is a way to help you solve differences and live a life beyond judgment.\n\nAre you ready to practice it with me? For all you need is just peace. Let us now move into the meditation.\n\n*(Teachings referenced: breath awareness, golden light)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XmkNwgkMC3U", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GQZ7A4fvts4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OzgA9wYM6Oc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-0O6WmxU3pw", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 06:35:00+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier":