f994bf53-373e-47f9-bf2f-2b8a3189515d	c1d19242-44ad-46e1-962f-9aba829a33c4	Namaste. Let's walk through this together.\n\nThe first sacred secret, as revealed by Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji, is the profound understanding of **Ekam Kshetra**.\n\nThey explained that Ekam Kshetra is one of the three most sacred spaces on earth, a divine playfield where grace overpowers fate. The word "Ekam" means "one," referring to the highest state of non-dual consciousness that can be experienced while in the human body.\n\nSri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji revealed that this special power in this land called them, waiting for centuries to hold this state of oneness. It's not just a place, but a *Kshetra*—a field—because it's designed to draw infinite cosmic energies into it. This field is built based on a design from an 800-year-old revelation and is constructed as a three-dimensional Surya Yantra.\n\nEvery morning, when the first rays of the sun touch the Amruta Kalesha of Ekam, every inch of the sacred ground gets charged with celestial energy. It is the only temple in the world dedicated to the worship of Hiranyagarbha, the primordial form of the divine from which all of creation emerged.\n\nSo, the first sacred secret is this foundational concept of a place, a field, that is dedicated to the worship of the primordial divine and is designed to help us experience that state of oneness while we are still in our human bodies. It is the very ground of their teachings, the place from which this beautiful state can emerge.\n\nDoes this resonate with what you are seeking?\n\n*(Teachings referenced: Four Sacred Secrets, spiritual vision, inner truth, universal intelligence, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSAPs1YDkq0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 06:38:08+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "fast", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSAPs1YDkq0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18"], "model_provider": "sarvam_cloud", "route_decision": "fast", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSAPs1YDkq0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"], "retrieved_count": 17, "confidence_score": 5.0, "retrieval_queries": ["Explain the first sacred secret. spiritual vision inner truth universal intelligence"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSAPs1YDkq0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3EqnSkAzfIg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-yGLiryVQoQ", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jK7-PPBXwr4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n3UBbCXJaJ0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HELtP96Dd4w", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sMgbjxyrgqw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tl2Ek-QakME", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=fj2_d2lNGVk"], "final_answer_chars": 1618, "llm_expansion_count": 0, "verification_passed": false, "generated_answer_chars": 1618}	default
