b9f315a9-3fc7-434d-8461-7d7ee5362e95	1aa659ca-bde6-488d-bf18-07e724b26207	Namaste, beloved seeker. That is a beautiful and profound question, and it touches upon one of the most essential teachings shared by Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji.\n\nThe second secret about Inner Truth is that true, lasting greatness does not come from external achievements, but from the deep and honest work of understanding and embracing our own inner truth.\n\nLet us look at the life of Mahatma Gandhi, a beautiful example of this principle. He faced immense inner turmoil, with feelings of anger and shame. Instead of suppressing these, he learned to transform them. He turned his anger into a powerful force for compassion, and his shame into a deep empathy for the suffering of others. This inner transformation was the very foundation of his nonviolent resistance, a force that inspired a nation.\n\nSri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji often warn us not to mistake our negative emotions for positive traits. For instance, using stress or worry as a motivator might seem to get things done, but it creates a dependency on that suffering and leads to more struggle. It is a fragile kind of greatness.\n\nThe path they illuminate is one of awareness. By recognizing our inner states—whether they are joy, fear, or anger—without judgment, we can connect with our true divine nature. This fosters genuine connections with others and allows for an authentic, effortless greatness to blossom.\n\nSo, the second secret is not a technique, but a journey of the heart. It is the invitation to look within, to see our truth, and to let that light guide us. May you find peace in this exploration.\n\nWatch more here: [No specific link provided in the context for this teaching]\n\n*(Teachings referenced: Four Sacred Secrets, spiritual vision, universal intelligence, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n3UBbCXJaJ0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 06:40:16+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "fast", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n3UBbCXJaJ0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18"], "model_provider": "sarvam_cloud", "route_decision": "fast", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n3UBbCXJaJ0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"], "retrieved_count": 13, "confidence_score": 5.0, "retrieval_queries": ["What is the second secret about Inner Truth?"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n3UBbCXJaJ0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bCzjP2UaKRI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-4wCvcPrX-E", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk"], "final_answer_chars": 1776, "llm_expansion_count": 0, "verification_passed": false, "generated_answer_chars": 1776}	default
