c06ad808-9e9d-4325-aaf8-709fe9c75916	4a704a38-45ac-4567-8e63-baa867a0a0eb	Namaste. It gives me great joy as I look forward to teaching you Soul Sync for peace. We will be meditating every day for one specific cause: peace. And this will be your strength to dissolve your inner violence. It will be your magic wand to heal your heart and to move on with life. It will be your genie to solve existing challenges and your gateway to a peaceful life.\n\nSoul Sync for peace has opened millions to solve the differences and live a life beyond judgment and division. Are you ready to practice it with me? For all you need is just peace. All that your loved ones, your family and the world needs is just peace.\n\nLet us now move into the meditation. Please sit with your eyes closed. Hold your spine erect and your body still.\n\n**The Practice of Soul Sync**\n\nWe will move through three stages. Let us begin.\n\n**Stage 1: The Eight Conscious Breaths**\n\nTake eight conscious breaths. Use your fingers to keep count. For the first breath, touch the thumb and the index finger of both your hands. For the second breath, thumb and the middle finger, and so on. In this manner, you will take eight complete breaths. If during a particular breath, your mind wanders, keep touching the finger and bring your attention back to breath. Let us begin.\n\nAnd as you move into the rest of your day, you may experience a harmonious flow with life. Let there be abundance in your life. Let there be abundance in the lives of your loved ones. Let there be abundance in the world.\n\n**Stage 2: The Bee Breath (Humming)**\n\nInhale deeply and as you exhale, make a humming sound, like a bee. Your hum must be strong enough to create a vibration in your head. Please pay total attention to the sound. Each time you hum, you will touch the tips of your fingers with your thumb, and we will do this eight times. So you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you, you,