reath meditation, breath awareness meditation) breath awareness humming pause breath awareness presence higher consciousness expanded awareness unity consciousness"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5hNCT4duOgc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XmkNwgkMC3U", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zO8tQkjCpyc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M_BYTcsLQuY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OzgA9wYM6Oc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o_eg6YTifRE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q_CMuXKuvoU", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-4qvpm4Rd6Q", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O-6f5wQXSu8"], "final_answer_chars": 6820, "llm_expansion_count": 0, "verification_passed": false, "generated_answer_chars": 6820}	default
2d1499bf-b870-46fa-bb3e-834b2588a163	6dc20faf-c448-4cea-a85b-8f585e75bdda	Namaste. Let me talk to you about the first sacred secret, which is the very foundation of our understanding of Ekam Kshetra. The first sacred secret is that we live in a divine playfield called Ekam Kshetra, the oneness field. Here, grace overpowers fate.\n\nThe word "Ekam" itself refers to the highest state of non-dual consciousness that can be experienced while in the human body. It is the state of oneness. And we named this divine Kshetra after a revelation happened to Prithaji. The word Ekam Kshetra is special because this land had waited for centuries to hold Ekam. It is one of the three sacred spaces on earth with extraordinary gridlines that draw infinite cosmic energies into it. It is a field, not just ordinary land, because it is built as a three-dimensional Surya Yantra, charged with celestial energy.\n\nWhen the first rays of the sun touch the Amruta Kalesha of Ekam, every inch of the sacred ground gets charged with this energy. This is the first secret: that you are in a place of immense power, a field where the divine is accessible, and your very presence here is a result of a special, revealed grace. It is a place where the universe's potential is held in a tangible, sacred form.\n\nI hope this explanation brings some clarity to the heart of this teaching. Remember, this is not just a concept to understand, but a reality to be felt. May you find peace in this understanding.\n\n*(Teachings referenced: Four Sacred Secrets, spiritual vision, inner truth, universal intelligence, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oSAPs1YDkq0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 12:25:28+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "mo