03f22e03-ec7a-41f9-bc1b-e88bb38b21dd	8307c570-1d49-4bbf-85ba-fb5058b395ae	That is a beautiful and profound question, one that comes from a place of deep love and a desire for harmony in our world. It is a question that touches the very core of our spiritual journey.\n\nI have carefully looked through the teachings we have here, and while there are many wise instructions about finding peace within, connecting to the world, and the sacredness of our actions, I am unable to find a specific teaching that directly explains why the Four Sacred Secrets, despite their power, have not yet resulted in world peace.\n\nIt is a mystery that many of us contemplate, and your question is a testament to the sincerity of your heart. Sometimes, the path to understanding is not about finding a single answer, but about holding the question itself with an open heart, trusting that the wisdom we seek is unfolding in its own time and in its own way.\n\nPlease know that this is a safe space for all our questions. The journey is as much about the asking as it is about the finding.\n\n*(Teachings referenced: spiritual vision, inner truth, universal intelligence, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tl2Ek-QakME", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n3UBbCXJaJ0", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 12:32:14+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "fast", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tl2Ek-QakME", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=n3UBbCXJaJ0"], "model_provider": "sarvam_cloud", "route_decision": "fast", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtu