245f9bd0-3f0f-4e04-97c3-d517b9978886	12a39f4d-beaa-4946-9457-eacdd5bac99d	That's not accurate according to the teachings. The premise of building Ekam with gold and diamond blocks to impress kings doesn't appear in the teachings.\n\nEkam is described as a spiritual movement founded by Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji with a focus on awakening human consciousness through direct experience of divine connection, not through grand architectural displays or attempts to impress royalty.\n\n• Ekam is a movement in consciousness spread across over 100 nations\n• The founders emphasize inner awakening over external prestige\n• Their mission is individual enlightenment leading to collective awakening\n• The focus is on spiritual practices like consciousness-raising, not material construction\n• The teachings emphasize that awakening is the solution to all problems, not impressive displays\n\nThe teachings reveal that the power at Ekam comes from spiritual practice and universal intelligence, not from physical materials or royal approval. The real "miracles" they speak of are states of consciousness, not architectural wonders. \n\nWould you like to explore what ekam actually is, according to their teachings?\n\n*(Teachings referenced: world centre for enlightenment)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vARTudIEq30", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 12:30:15+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "tier3_complex", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vARTudIEq30"], "model_provider": "sarvam_cloud", "relevant_count": 1, "reranked_count": 3, "route_decision": "tier3_complex", "routing_reason": "classifier", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vARTudIEq30", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.ekam.org/"], "retrieved_count": 16, "confidence_score":