74dc0bdc-c3ed-4666-8568-da4a39b30a1b	3b31a16d-03d5-4312-9177-71b2c86bb113	I understand you are seeking to understand the specific sequence of powers in Manifest 2026, and I hear the importance you place on finding that clarity.\n\nAfter reviewing the teachings from Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji that are available to me, I am unable to find specific information about the list of powers in Manifest 2026 or the exact month that comes before the Power of Gratitude. Their teachings do not provide a fixed calendar of these energies.\n\nWhat I can share, from their wisdom, is the deeper principle behind such a journey. The core of their teaching is about moving from conflict to clarity. They explain that conflict persists in us when our mind is dabbling in suffering states. But when we dissolve those suffering states, we arrive at clarity, and from that clarity, we arrive at a decision.\n\nThis process of transformation, of activating that inner power through practices like meditation, is what truly matters. It's about transforming into a strong decision-maker, so that situations don't wear you down and challenges don't beat you down. The focus, then, is less on the specific month and more on the state of being you wish to cultivate. By aligning with beautiful, clear states of consciousness, you build the inner strength to navigate any challenge.\n\nTrust in the journey of transformation, and know that the path itself is the manifestation.\n\nI am unable to find specific teachings on this topic.\n\n*(Teachings referenced: monthly power, Power of Intention, October, Letting Go)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KB_rdqB-sVw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qQmrTz6i2x4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 12:39:03+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "fast", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KB_rdqB-sVw", "https://www