90942b47-13ec-4ed1-9726-68819dcec3b0	d0b6bc4e-9cdd-4def-bbed-55d670dd5232	My dear seeker, it is a beautiful and important question to ask about the nature of wealth creation. While the texts you have shared do not number this as a "Fifth Sacred Secret," they offer a profound and essential teaching on this very topic. The core of this wisdom is not a technique, but a fundamental shift in the state of the one who creates.\n\nThe teachings point to a crucial distinction between two types of wealth creators.\n\nOn one hand, there is the unawakened wealth creator. This person is driven by pleasure. They run after pleasure to escape their own unhappiness, and in doing so, they suffer a failure of intelligence. Their purpose becomes making endless money, and they exploit every resource possible. This path is one of self-obsession, where the top priority is oneself over everyone else. It is a state of constant struggle and suffering.\n\nBut then, there is the awakened wealth creator. This is where the true secret lies. Their heart is awakened to a beautiful state of gratitude or compassion. They are no longer driven by themselves, but by a purpose that is larger than themselves. When you tune into the needs of the people around you and the needs of the earth from this place of gratitude, you are driven by a passion to create a difference.\n\nAnd here is the miracle: when you are in that beautiful state, you see the problem very crystal clear. A tremendous amount of intelligence flows into you. Strength, courage, and vision return. You act from that place of calm, joy, and connection, and your actions become spiritual. The universal intelligence comes to your aid with synchronicities to support your mission.\n\nSo, the secret is this: wealth creation is not about the money itself, but about the state from which you create. It is the shift from being driven by suffering and pleasure to being driven by purpose and compassion. When you dissolve your own suffering and act from a place of connection, you not only create wealth in a sustainable way, but you also become a force for good in the world.\n\nIt is a journey from self-obsession to selfless service, from being stuck in suffering to walking out of it effortlessly, and from creating for oneself to creating for the good of all. This is the heart of conscious and awakened wealth creation.\n\nI am unable to find specific teachings on this topic.\n\n*(Teachings referenced: Four Sacred Secrets, spiritual vision, inner truth, spiritual right action, not exist, only four)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vARTudIEq30", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 12:48:20+00	{"intent": "ADVERSARIAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "fast", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vARTudIEq30", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw"], "model_provider": "sarvam_cloud", "route_decision": "fast", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vARTudIEq30", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"], "retrieved_count": 11, "confidence_score": 5.0, "retrieval_queries": ["What is the Fifth Sacred Secret of wealth creation? spiritual vision inner truth universal intelligence"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watc