86fa097f-056b-495b-ad31-7be8ef08d6ed	ab407cd3-c6a9-44f0-aa7b-870f08865585	The Power of Intention, as understood through the teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji, is the mind's profound ability to shape reality. It begins with the understanding that the mind is not a passive observer but an active generator of our experience. Our thoughts, beliefs, and mental states are a wellspring of power, constantly creating our inner world and, by extension, affecting the world around us.\n\nThe true power of intention is unlocked when we learn to consciously direct this influence. This is where the concept of a "beautiful state" or a "connected state" becomes essential. When you are living in a beautiful state of consciousness, your energy, intelligence, and vitality are undivided. This is the fertile ground where intention can take root and grow.\n\nImagine trying to create something beautiful while your mind is in a state of stress or anxiety. As Sri Krishnaji often explains, that inner conflict is destructive. It divides your attention, consumes your energy, and clouds your ability to decide clearly. You are, in essence, pushing against yourself. But when you are in a beautiful, connected state, holding a clear intention is a different experience. It is not a struggle; it is a natural, powerful flow. From that state of clarity, you can create a destiny, because your energy is fully aligned with your desire.\n\nSo, when you ask about the Power of Intention in Manifest 2026, you are asking how to apply this timeless principle to a future goal. The teachings suggest that the power lies not in the future date itself, but in the *present moment* of your inner state. The process is to first cultivate that beautiful, connected state within yourself. Once you are there, you can hold a very clear and focused intention about what you wish to manifest in 2026. The power is in the combination: a clear mind, a beautiful state, and a specific, heartfelt intention.\n\nThe journey begins with transforming your inner world. By creating that state of inner peace and clarity, you are giving yourself the most powerful tool to create the outer world you desire. It is a process of moving from a divided state of wanting to a unified state of being, where your very presence becomes a magnet for your dreams.\n\nI am unable to find specific teachings on this topic.\n\nWatch more here: [No relevant links found in the provided context]\n\n*(Teachings referenced: monthly power)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jK7-PPBXwr4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XS9EXhxRbi8", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 12:48:26+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "fast", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jK7-PPBXwr4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XS9EXhxRbi8", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"], "model_provider": "sarvam_cloud", "route_decision": "fast", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jK7-PPBXwr4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XS9EXhxRbi8", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest"], "retrieved_count": 18, "confidence_score": 5.0, "retrieval_queries": ["What is the Power of Intention in Manifest 2026? manifest 12 powers monthly"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jK7-PPBXwr4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xUO_WoOlWmI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XS9EXhxRbi8", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https: