89162823-db21-44bf-b4d9-555fb2996ae0	8f49f533-afb7-4c22-baab-1d82120b2c2f	The Beautiful State is a profound inner condition of presence and connection, distinct from a fleeting emotional high. \n\nIt is a state of being where there is no inner conflict, and you are deeply present to life. \n\nA suffering state, in contrast, is one of inner conflict and agitation, where you carry past burdens. For example, in the story, one woman (Nomi) remains agitated long after an event, while another (Yesmi) is calm and present. \n\nThis state is not just a feeling; it is the very ground of your consciousness, the foundation upon which your drive and willpower can truly thrive. \n\nCultivating it is the essence of the teachings, allowing for powerful and sustainable action in all areas of life.\n\n*(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJxGtSDiayM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 12:49:25+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "router_route": "FACTUAL", "router_score": 0.7930268631498976, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJxGtSDiayM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU"], "model_provider": "sarvam_cloud", "relevant_count": 3, "reranked_count": 6, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "semantic_router_embedding", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJxGtSDiayM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU"], "retrieved_count": 14, "confidence_score": 10.0, "needs_web_search": false, "relevant_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJxGtSDiayM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU"], "reranked_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch