06f4bf6f-b042-469b-97b9-c5e8579b5123	5704648d-9899-4a95-a6e0-b364bc594d3d	The Oneness Movement and the construction of Ekam are rooted in the shared wisdom of its co-founders, Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji, who come from a lineage of revered sages. Their journey began with a shared vision to unite ancient wisdom with modern science, creating a path for direct experience of the divine.\n\n* **Biographical Foundation:** Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji are enlightened spiritual masters whose teachings have inspired millions. They are the co-creators of the Oneness Movement, which has spread across more than 100 countries, touching the lives of people globally.\n\n* **Ekam's History and Purpose:** The movement is named **Ekam**, which signifies the highest state of non-dual consciousness. The word "Ekam" was revealed to Sri Preethaji, and the name was chosen because this divine space had waited for centuries to hold this state of oneness. The Oneness Movement is built on the foundation of **Ekam Kshetra**, a divine playfield where grace overpowers fate and problems give way to an extraordinary destiny.\n\n* **Ekam Construction:** Ekam was constructed based on an 800-year-old revelation and designed as a three-dimensional **Surya Yantra**. It is considered one of the three most sacred spaces on earth, dedicated to the worship of **Hiranyagarbha**, the primordial form of the divine where matter and consciousness coexisted. Every morning, as the first rays of the sun touch the sacred ground, it is charged with celestial energy, creating a powerful field for spiritual transformation.\n\nThis movement has led millions to awaken from illusion and experience profound peace, with events like the Field of Awakening and Oneness Abundance Festivals inspiring people to transcend limitations and embrace a life of abundance and joy.\n\n \n\n*(Teachings referenced: world centre for enlightenment)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rXkyO0fOOLE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vARTudIEq30", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.ekam.org/", "https://theonenessmovement.org/"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 12:51:56+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rXkyO0fOOLE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vARTudIEq30", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0"], "model_provider": "sarvam_cloud", "relevant_count": 3, "reranked_count": 3, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "heuristic_simple", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rXkyO0fOOLE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vARTudIEq30", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.ekam.org/", "https://theonenessmovement.org/"], "retrieved_count": 17, "confidence_score": 5.0, "relevant_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rXkyO0fOOLE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vARTudIEq30", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0"], "reranked_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rXkyO0fOOLE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vARTudIEq30", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0"], "retrieval_queries": ["Explain the full history of the Oneness Movement, Ekam construction, and the biography of both co-founders."], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rXkyO0fOOLE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zs_JKa0cVsY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AR0r8B6Ga8E", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y9iL10DPhzI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vARTudIEq30", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mbhdVEKEbLg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U1qRvz3hnMA"], "final_answer_chars": 1827, "llm_expansion_count": 0, "verification_passed": false, "generated_answer_chars": 202