b9105ea2-a2c0-413c-a0bf-b3c8620d2231	440c3a70-2f9f-41c6-84ff-9e7dac46b53b	I understand why this question arises. The word "worship" can be misleading. In the Oneness tradition, the guidance is not about worshipping Sri Krishnaji and Sri Preethaji as gods, but about recognizing them as teachers who point the way. ✦ The core teaching is about transforming your own consciousness, not about following an external divine authority. It’s a path of inner change, focusing on the outcome: a **Beautiful State** of being. ✦\n\nThe concept of **Deeksha** here is a profound initiation into this inner work, not a mark of divine status. ✦ Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji share secrets to help you experience reality as it is—unseparate, whole, and intelligent. ✦ Their role is to be a mirror, showing you the possibility of your own transformation, not an object of worship.\n\nThe focus is on the practice and the result—living free from fear and aggression—rather than on the personality of the teacher.\n\nThis clarity is the first step of inner truth.	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3RyCldrCxL8", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 12:52:03+00	{"intent": "ADVERSARIAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "tier3_complex", "memory_used": true, "router_route": "ADVERSARIAL", "router_score": 0.6891535576046679, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3RyCldrCxL8", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4"], "model_provider": "sarvam_cloud", "relevant_count": 3, "reranked_count": 3, "route_decision": "tier3_complex", "routing_reason": "semantic_router_embedding", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3RyCldrCxL8", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.ekam.org/"], "retrieved_count": 20, "confidence_score": 