fdeaabb6-47b5-460f-9a70-b2d3acb321e3	ad2ca6a3-97fb-4995-9005-b6fa5c908138	It is wonderful that you are seeking to understand the hearts behind the teachings. Based on the wisdom shared in our context, Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji are the cofounders of the O&O Academy, a beautiful school dedicated to the exploration of philosophy, meditation, and the transformation of consciousness.\n\nSri Krishnaji is known as a global mentor and a profound meditation master, guiding many on their spiritual path. Sri Preethaji, in her role as a mystic and meditation creator, has shared her insights to millions through her talks, including her popular TEDx presentations, and leads events that beautifully blend the worlds of science and spirituality. Together, they emphasize the mystic force of Ekam, which helps seekers to transcend their limitations.\n\nIt is also heartwarming to see the personal side of their work, as they support their daughter, Lokaa, through foundations like World Youth Change Makers and One Humanity Care, empowering young leaders and making a positive difference in the world. Their journey is a testament to how deep spiritual wisdom can be shared with love and compassion.\n\nIf you would like to learn more about their specific teachings or the O&O Academy, please feel free to ask. There is always more to discover on this beautiful path.	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGryscyFmV8", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y9iL10DPhzI", "https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 13:33:55+00	{}	default
