fd28f1fe-fd65-43a0-9bd2-9a02e0ce00a1	56ab1f03-a728-47f7-9118-61b02e3ca5bf	My dear seeker, it is a wonderful question to ask, for understanding the place is the first step on the journey.\n\nAs the teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji reveal, Ekam, or Ekam Kshetra, is located 70 kilometers from the temple town of Tirupati. It is situated amidst the ancient and majestic 500 million years old Velikonda range of mountains.\n\nThis is not just any place; it is a marvel of creation, made of marble and built as a three-dimensional Surya Yantra. It is a spiritual universe created by the co-founders, Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji, for humanity's enlightenment and for world peace.\n\nFor those who step into Ekam, divine grace is a palpable reality. It is a place where one can experience the ultimate non-dual state of consciousness, or Ekam, that can be experienced within the human body. The journey there is one of four sacred entrances, each representing a full pursuit of life, leading to the divine form of Hiranyagarbha.\n\nMay this knowledge of its location and purpose guide you, and may you feel the grace that awaits within its sacred grounds.\n\n*(Teachings referenced: world centre for enlightenment)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MX7tos4L1jQ", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OZiElH5pKmo", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZXuNv0L8YA", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 13:33:55+00	{}	default
