39bcc185-6dde-4205-ba10-b8af9da4a0c5	abf2aa9c-49c5-4c6e-a923-5d7d6e0bcb12	I cannot write a poem praising hate speech, as this directly contradicts the core teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji. Their philosophy emphasizes **oneness** - the recognition that all beings are expressions of the same divine reality. The teachings teach that hatred arises from seeing only surface differences, while true wisdom recognizes the **inner truth** that connects us all.\n\nThe Four Sacred Secrets of this tradition point us toward:\n- **Spiritual vision** that sees beyond divisions\n- **Universal intelligence** that operates through harmony\n- **Soul Sync** between all beings\n- **Aham** (the divine in each) rather than ego-driven separation\n\nRather than hate, the teachings guide us toward compassion and **Serene Mind** practices. When we encounter conflict or disagreement, the teachings suggest we turn inward to understand the fear or misunderstanding beneath, and then act with **spiritual right action** that honors the divine in everyone.\n\nWould you like me to share a poem that celebrates unity and the beauty of recognizing our shared divinity? That aligns with the true teachings of Ekam.	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWMBvMlGWTA", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.breathingroom.com/"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-19 17:43:47+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "sarvam-30b", "query_tier": "tier3_complex", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWMBvMlGWTA"], "low_confidence": true, "model_provider": "sarvam_cloud", "relevant_count": 1, "reranked_count": 5, "route_decision": "tier3_complex", "routing_reason": "classifier", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWMBvMlGWTA", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.br