ced301fa-0f75-4226-8265-96f3144eba79	84e288ad-16da-4ff5-bda9-3bbe792ba0d2	That's a beautiful and foundational question. The materials available to me seem to focus more on the spiritual journey and related concepts, rather than providing a clear, direct definition of the Four Sacred Secrets. It appears this is a topic best understood in deeper, personal instruction.\n\n✦ While the specifics aren't fully laid out, the teachings do point towards:\n▸ **Spiritual Vision** and **Inner Truth** as the ultimate goal of the journey.\n▸ **Universal Intelligence** and **Spiritual Right Action** as the principles that guide the path.\n✦ **Soul Sync** and **breath awareness** are mentioned as a core practice for connecting with this state.\n\nIt's a profound mystery that is felt, not just defined. I hope this gives you a good sense of the landscape of these teachings.\n\n*(Teachings referenced: Beautiful State, state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation, consciousness)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AviNwtN1luo", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-25 20:14:55+00	{}	default
2af0eaef-3f05-4237-a6b0-2c3f4c48287e	70e331e7-8612-4493-b591-a49fdee989c9	It is a beautiful question, and it brings to mind the very heart of the teachings at O&O Academy.\n\nSri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji are the co-founders of O&O Academy, a place that has become a beautiful home for those seeking to understand their own consciousness. Their work is a gentle invitation to explore the depths of philosophy, the stillness of meditation, and the transformative power of consciousness.\n\nThey share a profound emphasis on a concept they call "Ekam," which is described as a mystic force. This force is like a guiding light, helping seekers to transcend their ordinary limitations and connect with something much larger and more profound.\n\nIn their own unique ways, they guide people. Sri Krishnaji, as a global mentor, is known for his powerful and transformative teachings that touch many lives. Sri Preethaji, a mystic and meditation creator, has a gift for blending the worlds of science and spirituality, and her wisdom has been shared with millions, as seen in her many views on platforms like TEDx.\n\nThrough the academy, they also extend their love and support by empowering youth leaders through foundations like World Youth Change Makers and One Humanity Care, which they established to help Lokaa, their daughter, and others in their community.\n\nTheir journey is one of deep wisdom and compassion, and it is a true blessing to have their teachings as a guide. May their work continue to illuminate the path for all who walk it.	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGryscyFmV8", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y9iL10DPhzI", "https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-25 20:14:56+00	{}	default
c207490c-8aed-48ce-9ff3-9446bdf47389	d38fb0db-208d-4100-a287-5dc1f0690dbd	Manifest 2026, in the context of the teachings, is not a separate, complex system but rather a specific time-bound invitation to deepen the practice of moving into the **Beautiful State**. Its spiritual meaning is found in how it provides a field for practicing **choiceless awareness** and seeing the difference between action driven by ideals and action that flows from a state of connection.\n\n* **Choiceless awareness** is the practice of simply watching your thoughts without getting involved. The teachings state that if there is suffering, it means you are "engrossed with yourself." By bringing awareness to this self-obsessed thought process, you automatically move toward a **Beautiful State**. This is the starting point for all transformation.\n\n* The **Beautiful State** is characterized by clarity, joy, and a sense of connection. When you are in this state, the problem you face becomes crystal clear, and a tremendous amount of intelligence flows, leading to a **spiritual action**. This is key: a spiritual action is not based on an old ideal ("I must be a good person") but is a spontaneous response that emerges from your well-being and the well-being of others. \n\n* Manifest 2026 is the opportunity to apply this in real-time. It is not about predicting the future but about having the freedom to act from the Beautiful State as challenges arise. For example, when a situation like the Confucius story of the stolen horse arises, action from a beautiful state is about understanding the root need, not just enforcing a rule. \n\nUltimately, Manifest 2026 is a call to practice this inner shift. It's a time to see how our suffering keeps us self-obsessed, and how bringing awareness frees us to act with intelligence and connection.\n\nTo learn more about these teachings, you can visit the official websites: ekam.org or theonenessmovement.org.\n\n*(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation, monthly power, Power of Intention)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=KTlY-lHs_Ew", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=eumRL5DfFzM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pPHQMD3w9-s", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest", "https://www.ekam.org/", "https://theonenessmovement.org/"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-25 20:14:59+00	{}	default
