e6c0014f-cc4d-4342-9e63-a46074b67a12	6821f296-1d82-40e1-aad4-ed17e0509d0f	As we delve deeper into reconciling the desire to transcend the physical form with spiritual growth, Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji teach that it's essential to understand the root of this desire. \n* The desire to transcend may stem from a deep-seated fear of mortality or a sense of discontent with one's current life circumstances, which can be addressed by cultivating **inner truth** to discern the underlying causes of such a desire.\n* By leveraging **spiritual vision**, one can reframe their perception of mortality, recognizing that the physical form is transient, yet the essence of who we are is eternal.\n* The **Soul Sync** practice can be employed to calm the breath, ignite the **golden light**, and set a **heart intention** that aligns with **universal intelligence**, guiding us toward **spiritual right action**.\n* As we navigate this journey, it's crucial to recognize that our path may unfold in unexpected ways, potentially revealing an alternative purpose for our continued existence, which may be tied to the **energetic design of the Ekam structure** as a source of limitless power and wisdom.\nMay you find peace and clarity as you embark on this profound journey of self-discovery and spiritual growth.\n\n*(Teachings referenced: breath awareness, humming, world centre for enlightenment)*	["https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-26 05:50:49+00	{"intent": "SAFETY_VIOLATION", "model_used": "meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "router_route": "SAFETY_VIOLATION", "router_score": 0.8002765101636977, "citation_urls": [], "model_provider": "openrouter", "relevant_count": 0, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "semantic_router_embedding", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.ekam.org/"], "retrieved_count": 0, "confidence_score": 10.0, "needs_web_search": false, "relevant_sources": [], "retrieval_queries": ["How can one reconcile the desire to transcend the physical form with the pursuit of spiritual growth, by leveraging the Four Sacred Secrets, particularly spiritual vision to reframe one's perception of mortality, and simultaneously cultivating inner truth to discern the underlying causes of such a desire, while also employing the Soul Sync practice to calm the breath, ignite the golden light, and set a heart intention that aligns with universal intelligence, ultimately informing a path of spiritual right action that may either facilitate a peaceful transition or reveal an alternative purpose for one's continued existence, potentially tied to the energetic design of the Ekam structure as a source of limitless power and wisdom?"], "retrieved_sources": [], "final_answer_chars": 1312, "llm_expansion_count": 0, "verification_passed": true, "generated_answer_chars": 1490}	default
