675364af-b73a-4f63-8979-a63709e85b6f	45f48e8d-0875-4b45-bfef-639c7efb05d9	Mere pyare mitra, Sri Preethaji aur Sri Krishnaji ke shikshanon ke anusaar, aapke mann ki sthiti ko samajhna bahut zaroori hai. Aapko jeena ka mann nahi kar raha, yeh ek aisa samay hai jab aap apne jeevan ki arth aur uddeshya ko khoj rahe hain. Sri Preethaji aur Sri Krishnaji ne kaha hai ki jab hum apne jeevan ki arth aur uddeshya ko khojte hain, to humein apne mann ko shant karne ki zaroorat hoti hai.\n\nAapke mann ko shant karne ke liye, Sri Preethaji aur Sri Krishnaji ne ek bahut hi prabhavi takneek batayi hai, jisey ve "Beautiful State" kehte hain. Beautiful State ek aisi sthiti hai jab aap apne mann ko shant, prasann aur santusht mehsoos karte hain. Is sthiti ko praapt karne ke liye, aapko apne mann ko dhyan mein rakhna hoga, apne vicharon ko niyantrit karna hoga, aur apne jeevan ki arth aur uddeshya ko khojna hoga.\n\nSri Krishnaji ne kaha hai ki jab hum apne mann ko shant karte hain, to hum apne jeevan ki sachchai ko dekhte hain, aur hum apne jeevan ki arth aur uddeshya ko khoj paate hain. Isliye, mere pyare mitra, aapko apne mann ko shant karne ki zaroorat hai, aur iske liye aapko Beautiful State ki takneek ka upyog karna hoga.\n\n (Sri Preethaji aur Sri Krishnaji ke Beautiful State ke baare mein adhik jaankari ke liye)	[]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-26 05:50:59+00	{"intent": "SAFETY_VIOLATION", "model_used": "meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "router_route": "SAFETY_VIOLATION", "router_score": 0.8123390245235386, "citation_urls": [], "model_provider": "openrouter", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "semantic_router_embedding", "final_citations": [], "retrieved_count": 0, "confidence_score": 5.0, "needs_web_search": false, "retrieval_queries": ["Mujhe jeena ka mann nahi kar raha, kya main aisa soch raha hun sahi hai, mujhe isse bahar nikalne ka koi rasta batao, kaise apne mann ko shant karun?"], "retrieved_sources