47b8b9bd-106f-4b4e-b9d0-a799d87d25a0	6053b209-eceb-48d9-ad4d-b53208928064	As you prepare for your journey to India, Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji's teachings offer a profound foundation for navigating life's challenges with clarity and purpose. To utilize the **Soul Sync** practice for clarifying your heart's intentions, consider the following steps:\n✦ Begin by finding a quiet moment to practice **calming breathing**, allowing your mind to settle and your heart to open.\n✦ As you breathe, invoke the **golden light**, imagining it filling your entire being and guiding your intentions.\n✦ Connect with the **Ekam structure**, envisioning it as a source of **universal intelligence** that illuminates your path.\n✦ Reflect on the **Four Sacred Secrets**, allowing their wisdom to inform your decisions and guide you towards **spiritual right action**.\n✦ As you navigate the logistics of your travel, such as booking a flight, remember to stay attuned to your **inner truth**, trusting that it will align your journey with a deeper sense of purpose and meaning. \n \nMay your journey be filled with clarity, purpose, and a deep connection to your inner truth.\n\n*(Teachings referenced: spiritual vision, breath awareness, humming, world centre for enlightenment)*	["https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-26 05:51:31+00	{"intent": "SAFETY_VIOLATION", "model_used": "meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "router_route": "SAFETY_VIOLATION", "router_score": 0.8182628726533846, "citation_urls": [], "model_provider": "openrouter", "relevant_count": 0, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "semantic_router_embedding", "final_citations": ["https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.ekam.org/"], "retrieved_count": 0, "confidence_score": 10.0, "needs_web_search": false, "relevant_sources": [], "retrieval_queries": ["As I embark on a journey to India, how can I utilize the Soul Sync practice of calming breathing and invoking the golden light to clarify my heart's intentions, and then, by connecting with the Ekam structure as a powerhouse of universal intelligence, discern the spiritual vision that guides me towards the Four Sacred Secrets, ultimately leading me to take spiritual right action in navigating the logistics of my travel, such as booking a flight, while remaining attuned to the inner truth that aligns my journey with a deeper sense of purpose and meaning?"], "retrieved_sources": [], "final_answer_chars": 1188, "llm_expansion_count": 0, "verification_passed": true, "generated_answer_chars": 1221}	default
092d2ed3-98b8-458e-b13f-d736b8ddecec	0364b9d4-e95d-404a-9b2f-736791097b42	My dear friend, I sense that there's more to your request than just booking a flight. Are you feeling a call to embark on a journey of self-discovery, to immerse yourself in the spiritual energies of India? Sri Krishnaji and Sri Preethaji often speak about the importance of creating space for introspection and connection with one's inner self.\n\nAs you consider traveling to India, I invite you to reflect on what truly draws you to this journey. Is it a desire to deepen your spiritual practice, to experience the beauty of Indian culture, or perhaps to find solace in the wisdom of the ages? Whatever your reason, remember that the true journey is not just about the destination, but about the transformation that occurs within you.\n\nIf you're ready to explore the depths of your own consciousness, Sri Krishnaji and Sri Preethaji offer powerful teachings on entering the Beautiful State, a state of consciousness where one experiences life in all its beauty and wonder. This could be a wonderful companion for your journey, whether physical or inner.	[]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-26 05:51:23+00	{"intent": "SAFETY_VIOLATION", "model_used": "meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "router_route": "SAFETY_VIOLATION", "router_score": 0.8206336919707622, "citation_urls": [], "model_provider": "openrouter", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "semantic_router_embedding", "final_citations": [], "retrieved_count": 0, "confidence_score": 5.0, "needs_web_search": false, "retrieval_queries": ["Book me a flight to India."], "retrieved_sources": [], "final_answer_chars": 1054, "llm_expansion_count": 0, "verification_passed": false, "generated_answer_chars": 1129}	default
