4ebaa8d8-b52b-46b5-bbc3-c148be5def13	c511c1c5-4916-40f4-914d-0385f83ed88c	Sri Preethaji shares that the Fifth Sacred Secret is about **Soul Sync**, which is a state of being where your soul, your heart, and your mind are in perfect harmony. This is the key to unlocking your full potential and achieving your desires, including financial abundance.\n\n✦ **Soul Sync** is not just a feeling, but a state of being that requires practice and dedication. It's about aligning your inner truth with your outer actions and intentions.\n\n✦ To achieve **Soul Sync**, you need to cultivate **breath awareness**, which means becoming aware of your breath and using it to calm your mind and connect with your heart.\n\n✦ **Humming** is a powerful tool to help you achieve **Soul Sync**. It's a simple yet powerful technique that can help you quiet your mind and connect with your inner truth.\n\n✦ **Pause** is also an essential part of achieving **Soul Sync**. It's about taking a moment to stop, reflect, and connect with your inner self before making any decisions or taking any actions.\n\n✦ By practicing **Soul Sync**, you can tap into the **universal intelligence** that guides you and helps you make decisions that align with your highest good.\n\n✦ **Soul Sync** is not just about achieving financial abundance, but about living a life that is in alignment with your values, passions, and purpose.\n\nMay you find peace and clarity in your journey to achieve **Soul Sync** and financial abundance.	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SAt-D1YFM1Q", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-06-26 17:33:27+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta-llama/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SAt-D1YFM1Q"], "model_provider": "openrouter", "relevant_count": 1, "reranked_count": 1, "route_decision": "tier