mbody the Beautiful State, acting from a place of connection, joy, and compassion. Remember, my friend, the key is to be consistent and patient with yourself. With regular practice, you'll find that the Four Sacred Secrets become an integral part of your daily life, guiding you towards a more authentic, purposeful, and fulfilling existence. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: spiritual vision, universal intelligence, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tl2Ek-QakME", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.breathingroom.com/"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-07-01 18:05:56+00	{}	default
