03499159-1abe-4eaf-bada-8663fe79c394	10bdff96-4c8c-490d-9f0d-07e886735ff3	My friend, love is a profound and multifaceted concept that Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have beautifully described in their teachings. According to Sri Preethaji, "Love is the energy that flows through all of existence, connecting us to each other and to the universe". Sri Krishnaji has also said, "Love is not just a feeling, it's a choice. It's a choice to see the divine in every being, to see the love in every being". In essence, love is not just an emotion, but a choice to see the interconnectedness of all beings and to choose compassion, kindness, and understanding in every interaction. It's a choice to see the divine in every person, and to treat them with love, respect, and care.	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HCs6I_BNtxo", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K-AFDVOkIoE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yf4Pld6UEdg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 19:00:42+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": false, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HCs6I_BNtxo", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K-AFDVOkIoE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yf4Pld6UEdg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 10, "retrieval_queries": ["What is love?"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HCs6I_BNtxo", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yf4Pld6UEdg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=K-AFDVOkIoE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zXjwi5tTcno", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ji7Zy_tDFQ4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQU