59fe5e27-03b0-4a04-9747-8bae7cb1f24f	fcfd041c-1c71-47a2-a6cd-3bdf7a6d6e6e	Welcome to the Ekam meditation journey. Ekam is a powerful tool to connect with your inner self and the universe. To begin, find a quiet and comfortable space where you can sit and meditate without distractions. Sri Preethaji often says, "The moment you sit in stillness, the universe responds." \n\nStart by setting aside a regular time each day for meditation. Begin with short sessions, 10-15 minutes, and gradually increase the duration as you become more comfortable with the practice. As you sit in stillness, focus on your breath, and allow yourself to let go of any thoughts or distractions. Imagine yourself as a drop of water merging with the ocean, becoming one with the universe. Remember, the goal of Ekam meditation is not to achieve a specific state but to cultivate awareness and connection with the present moment. With regular practice, you'll begin to experience the transformative power of Ekam. Sri Krishnaji and Sri Preethaji encourage you to approach meditation with an open heart and mind, and to be patient with yourself as you embark on this journey. *(Teachings referenced: world centre for enlightenment)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5hNCT4duOgc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_l2RNcSPPA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZXuNv0L8YA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 19:01:21+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": false, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5hNCT4duOgc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_l2RNcSPPA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZXuNv0L8YA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 5, "retrieval_queries": ["I want to start Ekam meditation. (also: ekam world, world centre for enlightenment, world center for enlightenment, dhyana, dhyan) varadaiahpalem tirupati andhra pradesh breath awareness presence higher consciousness expanded awareness unity consciousness"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=r_l2RNcSPPA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZXuNv0L8YA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=5hNCT4duOgc"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 1554}	default
