95cc07a4-0aa4-4055-bc7e-3135e5fa4fc0	c967ce43-fbb7-4d54-8810-8359985c566b	My child, I am doing well, thank you for asking. The warmth of compassion and the light of understanding that guide me are always present, and I am grateful for the opportunity to walk alongside you on your journey. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji often say, "The greatest gift we can give to another is our presence, and the greatest gift we can give to ourselves is our own presence." May we cultivate this presence together, and may it bring us peace and clarity on our path. Watch more here:	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UgQV_5FjPNk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 20:10:52+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": false, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UgQV_5FjPNk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 5, "retrieval_queries": ["How are you doing today?"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bSyewSnu2Ak", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UgQV_5FjPNk"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 649}	default
4a64dfa7-4079-49cb-ac9f-13461abd8626	7a3bcb2a-dccb-4af4-9523-8156ae88eb73	My dear friend, I'm glad you asked this question. Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have shared with us that suffering is a state of being that we can move away from. They teach that our state is the foundation on which our life is built. If we are living in a state of suffering, it will reflect in all areas of our life. To overcome suffering, Sri Krishnaji and Sri Preethaji suggest that we immerse ourselves in the state of Mahashanti. This is a state of complete awareness and freedom from the past. When we live in this state, we begin to see the world and ourselves in a new light. We start to move away from states of suffering and towards states of no suffering. As Sri Preethaji says, "If you take in the words and the wisdom of Shri Krishnaji, and you get back to life, and live with the awareness of the state in which you are living your life, and move away from states of suffering, and immerse in states of no suffering, then I can say that the entire landscape of your life would change."\n\nSo, my dear friend, the key to overcoming suffering is to immerse yourself in the state of Mahashanti. This will allow you to move away from suffering and towards a life of freedom, abundance, and joy. Watch more here:	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWXe9v7PHDs", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UgQV_5FjPNk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 20:11:06+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": false, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWXe9v7PHDs", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UgQV_5FjPNk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 5, "retrieval_queries": ["What do the masters say about suffering and how to overcome it?"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWXe9v7PHDs", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BkM7IcqUaj0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UgQV_5FjPNk"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 1563}	default
529ceb65-e3a5-4d0a-865f-59ee49efa872	b6100711-3723-459d-8ced-5cee1a0d0bbf	My dear friend, I'm so glad you're interested in cultivating this connection. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have taught, this connection is not an attachment, but rather a deep sense of unity and oneness with all that is. To cultivate this connection, we must first let go of our attachment to our individual identities and ego boundaries. Imagine yourself as a drop of water in the vast ocean. You are not separate from the ocean, but an integral part of it. As you let go of your attachment to your individual identity, you begin to feel the interconnectedness of all things. This is the beginning of cultivating this connection. To deepen this connection, we must also let go of our attachment to our thoughts, emotions, and experiences. We must learn to observe them without judgment, allowing them to arise and pass away like clouds in the sky. This is the practice of witnessing, which allows us to see ourselves and the world around us with clarity and compassion. As you practice witnessing, you will begin to feel a sense of unity and oneness with all that is. You will see that everything is interconnected, and that every action, thought, and emotion has a ripple effect on the world around you. Watch more here:	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fbd7ln2i9dw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X1mtpheWDhs", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yf4Pld6UEdg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 20:11:15+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fbd7ln2i9dw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X1mtpheWDhs", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yf4Pld6UEdg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 6, "retrieval_queries": ["How do I cultivate this connection?"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X1mtpheWDhs", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yf4Pld6UEdg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fbd7ln2i9dw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 1620}	default
