574ceb2d-c0f0-420b-aaaa-b1cdb0d4412c	3d95e02b-d165-418f-86db-651251fa542e	My dear friend, the question of what love is has been a timeless and universal inquiry. Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have beautifully captured the essence of love in their teachings. According to them, love is not just a feeling, but a state of being. It is a choice, a decision to see the divine in every person, every situation, and every moment. In their book, "The Bliss of Being," Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji write, "Love is not a feeling, it's a choice. It's a choice to see the divine in every person, every situation, and every moment." This choice is not just a intellectual understanding, but a deep, intuitive knowing that connects us to the world and to each other. Love is not just a romantic feeling, but a universal force that can be experienced in every relationship, every interaction, and every moment of life. It is a choice to see the good in everyone, to see the divine in every person, and to treat them with kindness, compassion, and respect. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji say, "When we choose to see the divine in every person, we are choosing to see the love in every person." This choice is not just a personal decision, but a global one, as it has the power to transform the world and create a more loving, compassionate, and harmonious society.	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HCs6I_BNtxo", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X1mtpheWDhs", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yf4Pld6UEdg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 20:13:53+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": false, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HCs6I_BNtxo", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X1mtpheWDhs", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Yf4Pld6UEdg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nU