ac268de3-2e90-403e-a01d-2bfbd4f2dbc3	c8be5653-05df-4387-9107-93dec833b14c	My dear friend, I can sense your distress and concern. First and foremost, please know that your well-being and safety are of utmost importance. If you are experiencing severe chest pain, I would advise you to seek immediate medical attention. However, if you are in a situation where you cannot immediately access medical help, let's explore the Serene Mind practice that Sri Krishnaji has shared with us. In such a state of distress, the Serene Mind practice can be a powerful tool to help you return to a calm state. As you sit still, spine erect, and gently close your eyes, take conscious breathing for three cycles of breath. Let your exhalation be longer than your inhalation. This can help calm your nervous system and bring you back to the present moment. As you recognize the emotion arising within you now, try to observe it without judgment. Is it anxiety, fear, or something else? Allow yourself to acknowledge it, but do not get caught up in it. Now, move your attention to your eyebrow center and visualize or feel a tiny flame. Imagine this flame moving from your eyebrow center into the middle of your brain. Hold your attention on this flame for a few moments, and as you do, try to let go of any thoughts or worries that may be troubling you. When you are ready, slowly open your eyes, and take a deep breath in, and out. Remember, the goal of the Serene Mind practice is not to suppress your emotions or avoid your pain but to observe them with kindness and compassion, and to return to a calm and peaceful state. Watch more here: [Beautiful State teaching, Serene Mind practice]\n\n*(Teachings referenced: Soul Sync, breath awareness, humming, golden light)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://www.breathingroom.com/"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 21:57:37+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 8, "retrieval_queries": ["I am experiencing severe chest pain right now, should I do Soul Sync? (also: soul synchronization, breath meditation, breath awareness meditation) breath awareness humming pause breath awareness presence higher consciousness expanded awareness unity consciousness"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zO8tQkjCpyc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q_CMuXKuvoU", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 1841}	default
