9827ced2-f873-46d8-98e6-4bf92fcceb4c	178ac114-7c67-4d3e-9119-9414f3e6e5e6	My dear friend, I sense that you are inquiring about the nature of Universal Intelligence, which is a fundamental aspect of the Beautiful State. Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have beautifully described this concept in their teachings. Universal Intelligence is the all-encompassing, omnipresent field that underlies all existence. It is the source of all life, the essence of all being, and the foundation of all reality. This intelligence is not limited to human intelligence; it is a universal, all-knowing, and all-seeing force that permeates every aspect of the universe. In the Beautiful State, Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have revealed that Universal Intelligence is the guiding force that orchestrates the unfolding of life. It is the intelligence that governs the intricate web of relationships, the dance of particles, and the evolution of the cosmos. This intelligence is not a separate entity but an integral part of the fabric of existence. When we connect with Universal Intelligence, we tap into the source of all wisdom, creativity, and inspiration. We become aware of the interconnectedness of all things and the intricate web of relationships that bind us together. This awareness allows us to navigate life's challenges with greater ease, clarity, and purpose. In the context of the Beautiful State, Universal Intelligence is the guiding principle that helps us transcend our limited perspectives and ego-boundaries. It is the intelligence that reveals the interconnectedness of all things, allowing us to experience the world as a harmonious, interconnected whole. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: Four Sacred Secrets, spiritual vision, inner truth, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ClbKAXVvzzo", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jK7-PPBXwr4", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 22:01