ba34eb08-a6dc-4d91-9583-3d2c2238055a	25156598-c220-41a4-8c69-8f0db8f841a9	My dear friend, I'm glad you asked about Spiritual Right Action. In the context of the Beautiful State, Spiritual Right Action is about aligning our actions with the present moment, rather than being driven by past regrets or future anxieties. It's about taking responsibility for our choices and actions in the here and now. As Sri Preethaji teaches, "Spiritual Right Action is the ability to respond to life's situations with awareness, clarity, and compassion." It's about being present in our actions, rather than being controlled by our thoughts and emotions. In the Beautiful State, we learn to observe our thoughts and emotions without judgment, and to respond to life's situations with awareness and compassion. This allows us to take action that is in alignment with our values and principles, rather than being driven by fear, anger, or other negative emotions. So, Spiritual Right Action is not just about doing the right thing, but about being present and aware in the moment, and taking action that is guided by our highest values and principles. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: Four Sacred Secrets, spiritual vision, inner truth, universal intelligence)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ji-hdW1t30g", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jK7-PPBXwr4", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 22:02:03+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ji-hdW1t30g", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jK7-PPBXwr4"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 10, "retrieval_queries": ["What is Spiritual Right Action?"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=jK7-PPBXwr4", "https://www.youtube.c