84ca46de-5a92-40d8-94d5-1d31367644b3	d61e3b68-7fb4-4fa2-bac7-45d7a56863a0	My dear friend, I see that you're asking about the Lokaa Foundation, but let's not get sidetracked from our beautiful conversation about the Beautiful State. Remember, we were exploring how living in a beautiful state can impact our external life and relationships. However, I'd like to clarify that the Lokaa Foundation is based in the United States. But, my friend, let's not focus on the physical location, but rather on how we can cultivate a beautiful state in our own lives. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji often say, "A beautiful state is not a destination, but a journey." It's a state of being that we can access at any moment, regardless of our circumstances. When we live in a beautiful state, we become more calm, peaceful, and loving, and this has a direct impact on our external life. Now, I'd like to ask you, my friend, have you ever experienced a moment where you felt completely at peace and connected to the world around you? Perhaps it was during a meditation practice, or while spending time in nature. Whatever the experience, I'd love to hear about it and explore how it relates to the beautiful state. *(Teachings referenced: villages)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 22:05:23+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=2z5qxSr4EaI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_XDcXdBDZ0c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 3, "retrieval_queries": ["Where is the Lokaa Foundation based?"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/w