5bbc3d65-3a98-4771-9721-3f0a34e6d720	cc7a9cee-32aa-4caf-a797-013c2d3ccabd	My dear friend, the vision of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji for humanity is one of profound transformation and awakening. They envision a world where individuals live in a state of inner peace, connection, and harmony with themselves, others, and the world around them. This vision is rooted in the understanding that our current state of suffering and disconnection is not the natural state of humanity. Rather, it is a result of our conditioning and the way we have been living our lives. Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji believe that by living in a beautiful state, we can break free from the cycle of suffering and create a more loving, compassionate, and peaceful world. Their vision is not just a utopian dream, but a practical and achievable reality that can be created through the application of spiritual principles and practices in our daily lives. By dissolving stress and living in a state of inner calm, we can experience a profound sense of connection and oneness with the world around us. This vision is not limited to individuals, but also extends to the way we live, work, and interact with each other. Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji believe that by applying the principles of a beautiful state in our personal and professional lives, we can create a more harmonious and sustainable world. As Sri Krishnaji has said, "When you live in a beautiful state, your life becomes a celebration of life." This is the vision that Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have for humanity - a world where life is a celebration, and every moment is an opportunity to experience joy, love, and connection. Watch more here:	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3RyCldrCxL8", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGryscyFmV8", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dR7olu353VY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-07-01 22:05:48+00	{}	default
