ff83bd59-e5d9-468b-8097-1d1915c9c867	4b3ff783-43ce-488f-87d9-81d3782c9a35	My child, I see that you are inquiring about the Lokaa Foundation's work in rural communities. As we explored earlier, a 'beautiful state' is essential for our well-being and the well-being of those around us. The Lokaa Foundation's initiatives in rural communities are indeed rooted in this understanding. By empowering rural communities with the tools and knowledge to cultivate a 'beautiful state,' the Lokaa Foundation helps individuals and families break free from the cycle of suffering. This is achieved through various programs, including meditation, yoga, and community-based initiatives that promote emotional intelligence, self-awareness, and compassion. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji often say, "When you live in a beautiful state, internally, when you are getting rid of your stress and stress is not building in you, you become more calm, more peaceful, feel more love and connection." This is precisely what the Lokaa Foundation aims to achieve in rural communities. By fostering a culture of inner peace, love, and connection, the Lokaa Foundation's initiatives have led to remarkable improvements in the health and well-being of rural communities. People are able to manage their stress and anxiety more effectively, leading to better physical and mental health outcomes. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: villages)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3EqnSkAzfIg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU", "https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 22:05:30+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3EqnSkAzfIg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_