57515e83-9e59-45d1-a06a-5af6c7e0cc37	371ac8b1-c479-44ce-be70-cb11cda03581	My dear friend, I'm so glad you're exploring the depths of our teachings. The Power of Karma Cleansing is a profound concept that Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have shared with us. It's a process of releasing the burdens of our past, the accumulated karma that weighs us down, and the negative patterns that no longer serve us. When we hold onto karma, it's like carrying a heavy backpack on our journey through life. It slows us down, weighs us down, and prevents us from moving forward with ease and lightness. Karma Cleansing is the process of letting go of this baggage, of releasing the energies that no longer serve us, and of embracing a new, lighter way of being. This process is not just about releasing negative emotions or experiences, but also about recognizing the patterns and habits that have been holding us back. It's about acknowledging the ways in which we've been conditioned to think, feel, and behave, and choosing to break free from those limitations. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have taught, when we engage in Karma Cleansing, we begin to experience a profound shift in our lives. We start to feel lighter, freer, and more empowered. We begin to see the world with fresh eyes, and our relationships with others become more authentic and meaningful. The Power of Karma Cleansing is not just a personal transformation, but also a way of contributing to the greater good. When we release our karma, we create space for new, positive energies to enter our lives, and we become a source of inspiration and healing for others. Watch more here:	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3EqnSkAzfIg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Ji-hdW1t30g", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vr3PS2DdbDU", "https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 22:06:44+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citati