59c52fc3-8369-4ce2-901a-7e0775e660ae	3b7ebcfc-b23f-4432-b63d-9b62aa16ce38	My dear friend, I'm glad you're interested in learning more about Manifest 2026. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have shared, Manifest 2026 is a powerful initiative that aims to awaken humanity to a new way of living, working, and being. It's a call to action, a movement that invites individuals to step into their highest potential and create a world that is more conscious, more loving, and more abundant. Imagine a world where people live in a state of inner peace, connection, and joy. A world where creativity, innovation, and entrepreneurship thrive, not just for personal gain, but for the greater good. This is the vision of Manifest 2026, a world where humanity is manifesting its highest potential, and creating a reality that is more beautiful, more meaningful, and more purposeful. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have shared, this is not just a vision, but a reality that is already possible. It's a state of being that can be accessed by anyone, anywhere, at any time. And it's not just about individual transformation, but about creating a collective impact that ripples out into the world. Watch more here: [Manifest 2026 Website]\n\n*(Teachings referenced: monthly power, Power of Intention)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qQmrTz6i2x4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wDaE92bNRNw", "https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 22:06:28+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qQmrTz6i2x4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wDaE92bNRNw"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_