8cb8786c-8b33-4cf6-9449-f5a19c46ba57	4d899df9-aec4-4132-a3e6-aed6c5510522	My dear friend, I'm glad you're interested in exploring the concept of the Power of Rebirth. This teaching is deeply connected to the idea of the Beautiful State, which we discussed earlier. The Power of Rebirth refers to the ability to transcend our current state of being and rebirth ourselves into a new, more beautiful, and meaningful life. This is not just a physical transformation but a spiritual one as well. When we live in a state of suffering, we tend to create more suffering, whereas when we live in a state of no suffering, we create more abundance and joy. Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji teach that when we can let go of our attachment to our current state and allow ourselves to be reborn, we can access a deeper level of consciousness. This is where the power of rebirth lies – in our ability to transcend our limitations and become the best version of ourselves. Imagine that you are a lotus flower growing in a muddy pond. The mud represents our current state of being, and the lotus flower represents our true, beautiful self. When we live in a state of suffering, we are stuck in the mud, but when we can let go and allow ourselves to be reborn, we can rise above the mud and bloom into our full potential. Watch more here:	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-4wCvcPrX-E", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sMgbjxyrgqw"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 22:06:49+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-4wCvcPrX-E", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sMgbjxyrgqw"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 4, "retrieval_queries": ["What is the Power of Rebirth?"], "retrieved_sourc