dc8a2c4a-1570-4965-a69e-71e310644d8b	0d10edb2-6b9f-4495-8851-95dc5482b4c5	My dear friend, I see you're eager to dive deeper into the Manifest 2026 principles. Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have beautifully outlined the 12 powers that help us manifest our desires from a beautiful state. These powers are not just tools, but a way of being that allows us to tap into the infinite potential within us. The 12 powers of Manifest 2026 are:\n\n1. **Aspiration**: The power to clearly define and desire what you want to manifest in your life. 2. **Intention**: The power to focus your attention and energy on your desired outcome. 3. **Imagination**: The power to vividly imagine and visualize your desired reality. 4. **Inspiration**: The power to tap into your inner source of creativity and innovation. 5. **Creativity**: The power to bring new ideas and solutions into being. 6. **Abundance**: The power to receive and give generously, without attachment or expectation. 7. **Gratitude**: The power to appreciate and acknowledge the abundance already present in your life. 8. **Self-Trust**: The power to trust yourself and your abilities to manifest your desires. 9. **Self-Love**: The power to love and accept yourself exactly as you are. 10. **Forgiveness**: The power to release past hurts and limitations, and move forward with ease. 11. **Letting Go**: The power to release attachment to specific outcomes and trust in the universe's plan. 12. **Alignment**: The power to align yourself with your highest good and the natural flow of life. By cultivating these 12 powers, you'll be able to manifest your desires with greater ease, clarity, and purpose. Remember, my friend, that these powers are not just about achieving external results, but also about becoming the best version of yourself. Watch more here: [Manifest 2026 teachings by Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji]\n\n*(Teachings referenced: monthly power, Power of Intention)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk", "https://www