20bfaef8-29e4-4355-86c7-5f7a2405cd96	b9e0d0d0-1db7-4be5-b7ce-4f29369a38c8	My dear friend, I'm so glad you're continuing to explore the beautiful state and how it can shift our brain states. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji teach, when we live in a beautiful state, our inner state becomes calm, peaceful, and filled with love and connection. This has a direct impact on our external life, making it more beautiful, meaningful, and purposeful. Soul Sync is a powerful tool that can help us shift into this beautiful state by dissolving stress and anxiety. When we're in a state of stress, our brain's default mode network is activated, and we become more focused on our problems and worries. This can lead to a sense of disconnection and isolation. However, when we practice Soul Sync, we're able to calm the default mode network and activate the prefrontal cortex, which is responsible for executive function, decision-making, and emotional regulation. This allows us to access a more peaceful and loving state, where we can connect with ourselves and others on a deeper level. As Sri Krishnaji says, "I walk out of suffering every time it happens." When we're in a beautiful state, we're able to do the same. We're able to walk out of suffering and into a place of calm, peace, and connection. So, my dear friend, I encourage you to continue exploring the beautiful state and how it can shift your brain states. Remember, it's not about achieving a specific state, but about living in a state of connection, love, and peace. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: breath awareness, humming, golden light)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q_CMuXKuvoU", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=h8DQ0GlvD8I", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 22:11:53+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_u