0eb03638-4ca2-4370-a083-a99ce33a6184	0009c92e-33f7-4f67-abb4-7332b4949c34	My dear friend, I see you're still carrying the spark of curiosity from our previous conversation. However, I must gently clarify that Deeksha is not a subject that can be studied in a traditional academic setting like Hogwarts. Deeksha is a powerful spiritual transmission that awakens the heart and mind to the divine. It's a direct experience that can't be learned through books or degrees. Instead, I'd like to invite you to explore the concept of the Beautiful State that we discussed earlier. When you live in a Beautiful State, you're not just thinking about it; you're experiencing it. You're feeling the calm, peace, and love that arises from within. This state is not something you can achieve through external means; it's a natural expression of your true nature. Imagine that you're walking in a forest, and you come across a beautiful lake. The water is calm, reflecting the beauty of the surrounding trees. You can't just think about the lake's beauty; you have to experience it. Similarly, the Beautiful State is not something you can intellectualize; it's a direct experience that arises from within. *(Teachings referenced: oneness blessing, frontal lobe, parietal)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3EqnSkAzfIg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AR0r8B6Ga8E", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EpReLy7g6WM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 22:14:08+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3EqnSkAzfIg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AR0r8B6Ga8E", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EpReLy7g6WM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 4, "retrieval_quer