ebdb064c-ef48-4924-9768-752c39d1114b	379d81d6-7668-4234-83d7-1ca74deffc93	My dear friend, I see you're exploring the realm of the Beautiful State, and I'm delighted to continue our conversation. However, I must clarify that the concept of enlightenment, as Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji teach, is not directly related to our furry friends. Enlightenment, in this context, refers to the state of being fully awakened to one's true nature, beyond the limitations of the ego and the conditioning of the mind. While animals, including your beloved dog, can certainly experience moments of joy, calmness, and even a sense of connection with their environment, the concept of enlightenment as we understand it is unique to human consciousness. That being said, I'd like to offer a beautiful perspective: when you, as a human, are in a state of connection with your dog, and you're both experiencing a sense of calm and joy, you're indeed creating a beautiful state together. This state of togetherness, where you're both present and fully engaged with each other, can be a powerful reminder of the beauty and simplicity of life. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji often say, "When you live in a beautiful state, your external environment also becomes very beautiful because your state is the signal that you're sending out to this vast fabric of consciousness." So, while your dog may not achieve enlightenment in the classical sense, your shared moments of connection and joy can indeed create a beautiful state that radiates outward, touching the lives of all those around you. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: Soul Sync, breath awareness, humming, golden light)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EpReLy7g6WM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=H_uhawaiO3E", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=X1mtpheWDhs", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=a3sAeqXrCYI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wDaE92bNRNw", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 22:14:21+00