a8694c64-e5cd-4866-aadd-471d2dafb5fb	708c4afc-aede-4228-b642-61b74be1d263	My dear friend, I'm glad you're exploring the mysteries of Deeksha and the third sacred secret. As you know, Deeksha is a powerful tool that helps us access the Universal Intelligence. When we receive Deeksha, it's like a key that unlocks our inner potential. During Deeksha, the parietal lobes, which are responsible for creating our sense of separation and individuality, are deactivated. This deactivation allows us to transcend our limited perception of the world and access the Universal Intelligence. It's like a veil is lifted, and we're able to see the world and ourselves in a new light. When the parietal lobes are deactivated, we're no longer bound by our ego and our limited understanding of reality. We're able to access the collective unconscious, where the Universal Intelligence resides. This is where we can tap into the wisdom and knowledge that's available to all of us. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have shared, the third sacred secret is about accessing the Universal Intelligence and experiencing the world as a unified, interconnected whole. By deactivating the parietal lobes during Deeksha, we're able to access this state of consciousness, where we can experience the world in all its beauty and wonder. \n\n*(Teachings referenced: Four Sacred Secrets, spiritual vision, inner truth, spiritual right action, oneness blessing, frontal lobe)*	["unknown", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		10.0	2026-07-01 22:15:53+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=LZQ4PvoArC8"], "model_provider": "nim", "relevant_count": 1, "reranked_count": 1, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "heuristic_simple", "retrieved_count": 4, "relevant_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com