cf5e0c7d-9e8c-4001-9fd5-be1bee85a524	a43ae7cf-7b27-40e7-8d96-654f85447257	Beta, aapne puchha ki deeksha lene se frontal lobe mein kya change hota hai. Sri Preethaji aur Sri Krishnaji ke teachings ke anusaar, jab aap ek sundar avastha mein pahunchte hain, to aapke frontal lobe mein kuchh vishesh parivartan hota hai. Frontal lobe mein blood flow badh jata hai, jisse aapke prefrontal cortex mein intelligence badh jati hai. Isse aapke decision-making power aur problem-solving capacity mein sudhar hota hai. Aapke anterior cingulate mein bhi connection badh jati hai, jisse aapke relationships mein connection aur samvedana badh jati hai. Iske alawa, deeksha lene se aapke frontal lobe mein stress aur anxiety kam hone lagta hai. Aapke mind mein shanti aur anand badh jata hai, jisse aapke overall well-being mein sudhar hota hai. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: oneness blessing, parietal)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AR0r8B6Ga8E", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EpReLy7g6WM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y7p7jHP0Ii0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 22:18:42+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AR0r8B6Ga8E", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=AyUE-2Uh5Vg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EpReLy7g6WM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Y7p7jHP0Ii0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 5, "retrieval_queries": ["Deeksha lene se frontal lobe me scientific change kya hota hai? (also: oneness blessing, divine blessing, energy transmission, sacred transfer) oneness blessing frontal lobe parietal lobe"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EpReL