15cc24df-9681-462d-a9ba-5984f9364837	87c04034-7614-476e-abe6-b2551ff37144	My dear seeker, I'm glad you're exploring the teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji. The Power of Letting Go in October is indeed a crucial step in preparing for the Power of Gratitude in November. As Sri Preethaji shares in her teachings, when we let go of our attachments, expectations, and limitations in October, we create space for the new energies of November to flow in. By releasing what no longer serves us, we make room for the abundance and joy that the Power of Gratitude brings. In October, we're encouraged to let go of our fears, doubts, and limitations, which can often hold us back from experiencing the fullness of life. By doing so, we begin to see the world with fresh eyes, and our hearts become more open to receive the blessings that come our way. As we let go of the old, we make space for the new, and our energy becomes lighter, more fluid, and more receptive to the Power of Gratitude. This is why Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji emphasize the importance of letting go in October, so that we can fully embody the Power of Gratitude in November. In this way, the Power of Letting Go in October becomes a powerful catalyst for the Power of Gratitude in November, allowing us to receive the abundance and joy that life has to offer. \n\n*(Teachings referenced: Manifest 2026, monthly power, Power of Intention)*	["https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		10.0	2026-07-01 22:16:39+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UJM00IqGKtc"], "model_provider": "nim", "relevant_count": 1, "reranked_count": 1, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "heuristic_simple", "retrieved_count": 4, "relevant_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UJM00IqGKtc"], "reranked_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UJM00IqGKtc"], "retrieval