50d8ca30-4e5a-460b-a8f1-b171ab07e07f	ddbf401d-d3b5-4cab-bc91-e19528fbfe68	My dear friend, I'm so glad you're exploring the beautiful state and how it's facilitated by the Power of Letting Go and the Power of Gratitude. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji share in the Manifest 2026 teachings, transitioning from a 'me-centric' suffering state to a 'beautiful state' is a profound journey. In October, the Power of Letting Go is a crucial step in this journey. It's about releasing the grip of our ego, our attachment to our thoughts, emotions, and experiences. When we let go, we create space for a new perspective to emerge. We begin to see that our suffering is not who we are, but rather a pattern that we've been living with. By letting go, we start to dissolve the boundaries that separate us from others, from the world, and from our true nature. As we let go, we create a vacuum that's filled by the Power of Gratitude in November. Gratitude is not just a feeling, but a powerful tool that helps us shift our focus from what's lacking to what we already have. When we cultivate gratitude, we begin to see the beauty in every moment, in every person, and in every experience. We start to appreciate the interconnectedness of all things and the abundance that's already present in our lives. The beautiful state that emerges from this process is not just a feeling, but a way of being. It's a state of connection, of love, of compassion, and of peace. When we live in this state, we're no longer controlled by our ego and our suffering. We're free to be our true selves, to live life fully, and to experience the world with wonder and awe. My dear friend, I encourage you to explore this journey further. Remember that the beautiful state is not a destination, but a way of being. It's a choice that we can make every day, every moment, and every breath. May you walk this path with ease, with love, and with compassion. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation, monthly power, Power of Intention)*	["https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		10.0	2026-07-01 22:18:15+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"], "model_provider": "nim", "relevant_count": 1, "reranked_count": 1, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "heuristic_simple", "retrieved_count": 4, "relevant_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"], "reranked_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"], "retrieval_queries": ["Explain how transitioning from a 'me-centric' suffering state to a 'beautiful state' is facilitated sequentially by the Power of Letting Go in October and the Power of Gratitude in November in the Manifest 2026 teachings."], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VO3fi1c9ids", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1kS_mQaBLdg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OWXe9v7PHDs"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 2303}	default
