ddd69fac-533a-478b-975a-6a00e3a7a6ed	3878d5c2-4224-409b-a3a4-a2f96077a970	My dear friend, I'm glad you asked about the Beautiful State. It's a state of consciousness that is the foundation of a life of connection, love, and passion. It's a state that allows you to transcend suffering and live a life of freedom and abundance. The Beautiful State is not just a feeling or an emotion, but a state of being that is rooted in your consciousness. It's a state of connection with yourself, with others, and with the world around you. When you're in the Beautiful State, you're not just thinking about your problems or challenges, you're experiencing them in a completely different way. Imagine you're walking in a forest, and you come across a beautiful meadow filled with wildflowers. You can see the beauty of the meadow, but you can also feel the beauty of the meadow. You can feel the connection between the flowers, the trees, and the earth. That's what it's like to be in the Beautiful State. In this state, you're not just thinking about your problems, you're experiencing them as opportunities for growth and connection. You're not just seeing your challenges as obstacles, you're seeing them as chances to learn and evolve. For example, let's say you're facing a difficult situation at work. You might feel anxious or stressed, but when you're in the Beautiful State, you can see the situation as an opportunity to learn and grow. You can see the people involved as fellow human beings who are struggling with their own challenges, and you can connect with them on a deeper level. This is not just a theoretical concept, my friend. This is a real and tangible experience that you can have in your daily life. When you're in the Beautiful State, you're not just thinking about your problems, you're experiencing them in a completely different way. You're experiencing connection, love, and passion, and you're living a life of freedom and abundance. \n\n*(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*	["unknown", "unknown", "unknown"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		10.0	2026-07-01 22:31:21+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "router_route": "FACTUAL", "router_score": 0.7930268631498976, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"], "model_provider": "nim", "relevant_count": 3, "reranked_count": 3, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "semantic_router_embedding", "retrieved_count": 5, "needs_web_search": false, "relevant_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"], "reranked_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"], "retrieval_queries": ["What is the Beautiful State? Explain it in massive detail with examples of suffering vs connection."], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qJxGtSDiayM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9Mv4Thnx9SU"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 2847}	default
248ebf49-df34-421f-87f3-6a7fb49b7385	ac4eef42-b36a-4737-bd72-e1480a71c335	My dear seeker, I'm glad you asked about the full history of the Oneness Movement, Ekam construction, and the biography of both co-founders. Let me take you on a journey through the timeline of this extraordinary movement. The Oneness Movement was co-created by Sri Prithaji and Sri Krishnaji, two enlightened spiritual masters who were born into a lineage of revered sages. Their wisdom has touched millions across more than 100 countries, and they have been recognized as mystic technologists for their ability to unite ancient wisdom with modern science and intuition with intellect. In 2008, they created Achim in India, the World Center for Enlightenment, where seekers from around the globe gather for meditation, personal enlightenment, and world peace. This marked the beginning of the Oneness Movement, which has since grown into a global phenomenon. Sri Prithaji and Sri Krishnaji have also created the Oneness Abundance Festivals at AOM in India, which are cherished for the profound love they foster within families, the prosperity they nurture in attendees, and the divine healing they offer to both mind and body. In addition to their spiritual work, they have also established the Lokaa Foundation, a nonprofit that is transforming over 1,000 villages through sustainable development and ecological restoration. Their daughter, Lokaa, has been instrumental in this effort, and the foundation's flagship project is to create model world villages that are self-sustaining and conscious. Now, let's talk about Ekam Kshetra, the divine playfield where grace overpowers fate. Ekam Kshetra is one of the three sacred spaces on earth that has the most extraordinary gridlines conducive to draw infinite cosmic energies into it. It is the only temple in the world dedicated to the worship of Hiranyagarbha, the primordial form of the divine in which matter and consciousness, space and time all coexisted before creation emerged from it. Ekam Kshetra is constructed based on the design of an 800-year-old revelation and is built as a three-dimensional Surya Yantra. Every morning, when the first rays of the sun touch the Amruta Kalesha of Ekam, every inch of the sacred ground gets charged with celestial energy. As for the biography of Sri Prithaji and Sri Krishnaji, they were born into a lineage of revered sages and have been recognized as enlightened spiritual masters. Their wisdom has touched millions across more than 100 countries, and they have been recognized as mystic technologists for their ability to unite ancient wisdom with modern science and intuition with intellect. Their daughter, Lokaa, has been instrumental in their spiritual work and has also been involved in the establishment of the Lokaa Foundation, which is transforming over 1,000 villages through sustainable development and ecological restoration. \n\n*(Teachings referenced: world centre for enlightenment)*	["unknown", "unknown", "https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest", "unknown", "unknown", "unknown", "unknown", "unknown", "unknown", "unknown", "unknown", "unknown", "unknown", "https://www.ekam.org/", "https://theonenessmovement.org/"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		10.0	2026-07-01 22:31:33+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rXkyO0fOOLE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0"], "model_provider": "nim", "relevant_count": 2, "reranked_count": 2, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "heuristic_simple", "retrieved_count": 4, "relevant_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rXkyO0fOOLE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0"], "reranked_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rXkyO0fOOLE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0"], "retrieval_queries": ["Explain the full history of the Oneness Movement, Ekam construction, and the biography of both co