49387168-da24-49b4-a22e-358ae6e96b5c	3ff77357-b8f1-4492-8b84-40b319cb0358	**Soul Sync Meditation**\n\n1. Breathe deeply with breath awareness.\n2. Practice bee humming and feel the vibration settle the nervous system.\n3. Rest in the pause between breaths.\n4. Chant A-hummm, also written as Aham, with gentle attention.\n5. Visualize golden light expanding through you into oneness.\n6. Set a heartfelt intention from this expanded state.\n7. Practice as a nine minute, 12 minute, 15 minute, or 20 minute daily morning ritual.	[]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		6.48	2026-07-01 22:31:39+00	{"intent": "MEDITATION", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "regex_prerouter"}	default
aecf8800-ae35-485a-96f0-1d5dc7506e7d	7ffbefec-1d85-4267-b56b-3ee8eb575bb6	My dear friend, I see you're eager to dive deeper into the Manifest 2026 principles. Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have beautifully outlined the 12 powers that help us manifest our desires from a beautiful state. These powers are not just tools, but a way of being that allows us to tap into the infinite potential within us. The 12 powers of Manifest 2026 are:\n\n1. **Aspiration**: The power to clearly define and desire what you want to manifest in your life. 2. **Intention**: The power to focus your attention and energy on your desired outcome. 3. **Imagination**: The power to vividly imagine and visualize your desired reality. 4. **Inspiration**: The power to tap into your inner source of creativity and innovation. 5. **Creativity**: The power to bring new ideas and solutions into being. 6. **Abundance**: The power to receive and give generously, without attachment or expectation. 7. **Gratitude**: The power to appreciate and acknowledge the abundance already present in your life. 8. **Self-Trust**: The power to trust yourself and your abilities to manifest your desires. 9. **Self-Love**: The power to love and accept yourself exactly as you are. 10. **Forgiveness**: The power to release past hurts and limitations, and move forward with ease. 11. **Letting Go**: The power to release attachment to specific outcomes and trust in the universe's plan. 12. **Alignment**: The power to align yourself with your highest good and the natural flow of life. By cultivating these 12 powers, you'll be able to manifest your desires with greater ease, clarity, and purpose. Remember, my friend, that these powers are not just about achieving external results, but also about becoming the best version of yourself. Watch more here: [Manifest 2026 teachings by Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji]\n\n*(Teachings referenced: monthly power, Power of Intention)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qQmrTz6i2x4", "https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-07-01 22:31:34+00	{}	default
f32c9a2c-430b-417c-bd49-6f066e062c44	dbfcc5fc-dbd6-4cd1-a335-ad3caf3bca3a	My dear friend, I can sense the depth of your question. It's a question that has puzzled many a seeker of truth. The Four Sacred Secrets, as Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have shared, are indeed powerful tools for transformation. However, the question of why world peace hasn't been achieved is a complex one, and it's not something that can be reduced to a single answer. But let me offer a perspective. The Four Sacred Secrets are not just about achieving world peace; they're about transforming the individual. They're about awakening to our true nature, beyond the limitations of our ego and conditioning. When we awaken to our true nature, we become a source of peace, love, and compassion in the world. The problem is not that the Four Sacred Secrets are not powerful enough; the problem is that we, as individuals, have not yet fully embodied these secrets in our lives. We have not yet let go of our fears, our doubts, and our limitations. We have not yet learned to live in a state of inner peace, regardless of the external circumstances. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have said, "The world will be at peace when we are at peace." So, the question is not why world peace hasn't been achieved; the question is, what can we do as individuals to create peace within ourselves, and then radiate that peace out into the world? Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: spiritual vision, inner truth, universal intelligence, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GfAMCHC6_ek", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dR7olu353VY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tl2Ek-QakME", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-01 22:31:46+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "mem