76ca2081-fcec-4095-a582-b9d6a3a4cd2c	077f7ad3-9de7-4f33-abc8-74b5082c8efd	My child, the Four Sacred Secrets are the foundation of the Beautiful State. They are the keys to unlocking the door to a life of freedom, purpose, and connection. The Four Sacred Secrets are:\n\n1. **The Secret of the Beautiful State**: This is the understanding that our state of being is not determined by external circumstances, but by our inner state. We can choose to be in a state of stress, anxiety, or fear, or we can choose to be in a state of peace, love, and connection. 2. **The Secret of the Present Moment**: This is the understanding that the present moment is all we have. The past is gone, and the future is uncertain. The present moment is where we can find freedom, peace, and connection. 3. **The Secret of the Power of Choice**: This is the understanding that we have the power to choose our thoughts, emotions, and actions. We can choose to react to a situation, or we can choose to respond in a way that is in alignment with our values and principles. 4. **The Secret of the Interconnectedness of All**: This is the understanding that we are not separate from others, but are connected to all of life. When we recognize this interconnectedness, we can see that our actions have an impact on the world around us, and we can choose to act in a way that is in harmony with the world. These Four Sacred Secrets are the foundation of the Beautiful State, and they offer us a way to live a life that is free, purposeful, and connected. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: spiritual vision, inner truth, universal intelligence, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-07-01 22:35:18+00	{}	default
