a576633a-f40d-4781-8b8e-4e99d41e62eb	7fa19ccb-929f-424d-9d09-2659a306df7a	My dear friend, I'm glad you asked about the concept of inner truth. According to Sri Krishnaji, inner truth is the fundamental awareness that lies within us, beyond the confines of our physical forms. It is the essence of our being, a unique expression of the universe that empowers us to choose our response, grounding us in the present moment. In the teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji, inner truth is described as a singular, non-specific entity, represented by the word "An." It is humble, simple, and foundational, connecting us to our inner awareness and the universe. By recognizing and embracing our inner truth, we can break free from the chains of suffering and find liberation. As Sri Krishnaji shared in his teachings, the root cause of all human suffering is obsessive, self-centric thinking, which keeps us preoccupied with ourselves and our problems. By understanding and letting go of this self-centric preoccupation, we can awaken to a sense of power, connection, freedom, and purpose. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: Four Sacred Secrets, spiritual vision, universal intelligence, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-05 03:26:14+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": false, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 8, "retrieval_queries": ["What is inner truth?"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3EqnSkAzfIg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"], "llm_expansion_count