2741b29e-09ad-4c6f-bc08-497d01140df7	5dc5da2d-dfa0-4a62-8b9d-c2e09aa75e40	**Serene Mind Meditation**\n\n1. Settle into a comfortable seat and let your body know it is safe.\n2. Bring attention to conscious breathing: breathe in gently and breathe out slowly.\n3. Notice racing thoughts, overthinking, stress, anger, frustration, grief, or anxiety without fighting them.\n4. Let the breath guide you toward a serene state of calm and inner connection.\n5. When you are ready, gently open your eyes and carry this calm into your next action.	[]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		6.48	2026-07-05 09:17:45+00	{"intent": "MEDITATION", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator"}	default
