f40c685f-aa12-4c77-82ed-7458554dca8e	d6779cec-6dde-4e1e-9945-03803324dac0	My dear friend, the beautiful state is a profound spiritual experience that Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have shared with many. It is a state of deep inner peace, love, and connection to the divine. Deeksha, or transmission, is a powerful tool used by Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji to guide individuals into this beautiful state. Through deeksha, the energy of the beautiful state is transmitted to the individual, allowing them to experience a deep sense of inner peace and connection to the divine. This transmission can awaken the individual to their true nature and help them to transcend their limitations. \n\nIn essence, deeksha is a catalyst for the beautiful state, allowing individuals to experience the profound peace and love that lies within. *(Teachings referenced: oneness blessing, frontal lobe, parietal, state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ACvOem_B-Ek", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-05 15:23:00+00	{"intent": "RELATIONAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": null, "memory_used": false, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ACvOem_B-Ek", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "fast", "routing_reason": "classifier", "retrieved_count": 8, "retrieval_queries": ["What is the relationship between the beautiful state and deeksha? (also: blissful state, state of bliss, state of calm, state of joy, oneness blessing) oneness blessing frontal lobe parietal lobe calm joy love"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Tc8f9ZasRRM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ACvOem_B-Ek", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=V45jIC4RthQ", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=obK5uqYXOJU"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars