c94c55fc-cb11-4a85-9d02-34768d51c786	44e8b3ae-f30b-4266-91ec-2c50a1115ccb	Based on the core teachings in my repository, I can guide you on several foundational concepts from Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji. These include the **Beautiful State**—the no-stress state of connection, joy, love, compassion, vitality, and passion, which is the intended ground for all action. I can also help you understand the **Stressful State** (anger, fear, hurt, loneliness) and its root cause: **Self-centric Thinking**, the obsessive preoccupation with oneself that keeps suffering alive. A key insight is **Inner Truth**—the realization that all lingering emotional suffering arises from this self-centric thinking, which is the antidote to suffering. For practical application, I can teach you the **Serene Mind** meditation, a 3-minute practice for returning to calm through conscious breathing, emotion recognition, and focused attention. I can also discuss **Connection** (feeling another's pain and acting from empathy) versus disconnection, and **Presence**—being engaged with the present rather than entangled in past or future. These are the core teachings I can share with you right now.	["Compiled from Beautiful State (TqxxCYnAxo8) and Serene Mind (igSp4H0OWLE) transcripts", "Compiled from Beautiful State (TqxxCYnAxo8) and Serene Mind (igSp4H0OWLE) transcripts", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "Beautiful State — Sri Preethaji (YouTube https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqxxCYnAxo8)", "https://www.breathingroom.com/"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		10.0	2026-07-06 05:59:19+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": [], "model_provider": "ollama", "relevant_count": 1, "reranked_count": 1, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "heuristic_capability", "retrieved_count": 8, "relevant_sources": [], "reranked_sources": [], "retrieval_queries": ["what teachings