75f14746-31bd-4939-b163-2999dfa922e5	37c322d4-c801-4f8b-ae5d-fffc20c15417	The Soul Sync meditation is a master practice of progressive relaxation, designed to be accessible for both beginners and seasoned meditators. It is a nine-minute meditation that invites you to relax, starting with the body to calm the mind and expand consciousness, leading to a state of self-transcendence. This transformative practice combines scientific and mystical elements to enhance consciousness and manifest heartfelt intentions. It involves six steps designed to silence the mind, calm the nervous system, slow thoughts, expand awareness, merge all energy into unity, and focus on desires for meaningful outcomes. It can be practiced anytime, such as upon waking or after the day's end, helping you experience synchronicity and achieve your goals through deep relaxation and expanded consciousness. The experience is one to be plunged into, for there is no way of knowing it until you immerse in it. *(Teachings referenced: breath awareness, humming, golden light)*	["unknown", "unknown", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "unknown", "unknown", "unknown", "unknown"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		10.0	2026-07-06 05:59:58+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OzgA9wYM6Oc"], "model_provider": "ollama", "relevant_count": 3, "reranked_count": 4, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 10, "relevant_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OzgA9wYM6Oc"], "reranked_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OzgA9wYM6Oc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=GQZ7A4fvts4"], "retrieval_queries": ["what is the Soul Sync meditation"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OzgA9wYM6Oc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI", "https://www.y