03efb515-4e73-45c2-a1bf-f592d8b306c1	42e456fe-5057-4e43-ab5c-855c6125be9c	Dear one, I see you are ready to walk the path of awakening to Universal Intelligence. The practice of the Third Sacred Secret is not about doing more—it is about *being* in a state where the intelligence of the universe can flow through you. From the teachings shared with me, the practice begins with a simple yet profound meditation that Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have offered. It is called the **Three-Question Meditation**, and it gently guides you from the surface of the mind into the depths of universal intelligence. Here is how you can practice it:\n\n1. **Sit still, spine erect, and close your eyes.** Bring your attention to your breath. Inhale and exhale deep and slow. 2. **Observe yourself with the first question:** *Are you in a stressful state or in a beautiful state?* Just observe—do not try to change anything. This loosens the grip of stress and opens a doorway. 3. **Observe yourself with the second question:** *Are you engaged with your past or your future, or are you in the present?* Simply notice where your mind is wandering. This brings you into the now, where universal intelligence resides. 4. **Observe yourself with the third question:** *Are you preoccupied with yourself, or are you in a state of connection?* This is the key. When you shift from self-preoccupation to connection, you align with the universal field. 5. **Imagine a flame glowing in the middle of your forehead.** Bring a gentle smile to your face. Hold this awareness for a few moments. 6. **When ready, open your eyes.** If you are with others, look into their eyes and wish from your heart that they live in a beautiful state. This practice is a direct way to move beyond the unconscious patterns and into the field of possibilities—the universal intelligence. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have shared, after purification, you are led beyond the unconscious to this plane where matter is not solid, but patterns of energy. Here, miracles cross the threshold of possibility into your reality. Practice this daily, and you will find yourself naturally awakening to the intelligence that guides all of life. Watch more here: *(if available)*\n\nMay your practice bring you into the flow of the universe.	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PslFhdZaBFA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UgQV_5FjPNk", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 06:33:03+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PslFhdZaBFA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UgQV_5FjPNk"], "model_provider": "ollama", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 8, "retrieval_queries": ["How do I practice it?"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UgQV_5FjPNk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PslFhdZaBFA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3EqnSkAzfIg", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0u9oe-5HPmk"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 2489}	default
968b01f1-44ad-464d-aada-35c95b489a9a	03ac706b-6d3f-462d-94e2-f88cd3b82b3d	My dear one, I see you are asking about Manifest 2026. Let me share what the teachings reveal about the manifest process itself, for that is the heart of your question. Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have guided thousands through a profound journey called the manifest process. It is not merely an event or a date—it is a deep inner purification where you are led into the deeper layers of your unconscious. There, all your destructive beliefs, tendencies, problems flowing from previous lives, early childhood memories, and deepest emotional wounds are stored. Manifest is a great purification where you spontaneously process the unconscious. After this purification, you are led beyond the unconscious to the universal intelligence. In this plane, matter is not solid. You see it all as patterns of energy. Here, matter shape-shifts. This plane of existence is a field of possibilities. As you are led into the mystic dimension of these processes, miracles cross the threshold of possibilities in your consciousness and manifest into your realities. The context does not specify "Manifest 2026" as a particular event or year. What is clear is that the manifest process itself is a transformative journey of purification and alignment with universal intelligence, where what was once impossible becomes possible. If you feel drawn to explore this path further, I invite you to sit with the question: *What in your life feels stuck or impossible?* That very place may be where the manifest process wishes to meet you. With warmth and blessings,\nMukthi Guru\n\n*(Teachings referenced: Beautiful State, state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*	["https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 06:32:33+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "query_tier": "tier2_simple",