74d16695-c718-40fd-942d-8f4d40d7a9c5	64968504-7850-40f2-815b-2a5d0b63e818	Dear one, I see you are seeking clarity on which of the Four Sacred Secrets speaks of Universal Intelligence. From the teachings that have been shared with me, the **Third Sacred Secret** is the one that guides you to awaken to Universal Intelligence. It is titled *“The Third Sacred Secret: Awaken to Universal Intelligence.”*\n\nIn this teaching, Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji reveal how moving beyond the narrow, limiting circle of “eye consciousness” – where everything seems separate and against you – opens you to a field of infinite possibilities. Here, intelligence, wealth, relationships, and grace flow effortlessly, and you begin to see the world not as solid matter but as patterns of energy and a field of possibilities.\n\nThis secret is a profound invitation to shift from a state of separation to a state of connection with the universal intelligence that pervades all of life.\n\nMay this answer light your path. If you wish to explore further, the full teaching is available in *The Four Sacred Secrets* book.\n\n*(Teachings referenced: spiritual vision, inner truth, spiritual right action)*	["unknown", "auto-extracted from Qdrant (13 chunks)", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "auto-extracted from Qdrant (13 chunks)", "unknown"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 06:32:54+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": [], "model_provider": "ollama", "relevant_count": 1, "reranked_count": 1, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 10, "relevant_sources": [], "reranked_sources": [], "retrieval_queries": ["Which one is about Universal Intelligence?"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bh_kjn-1CAY", "https://www.youtube.co