1361a2fc-3617-4b4b-99ea-30a4276e44a1	d5773163-4c19-4409-b3dd-4de69593ba57	Soul Sync is a beautiful, transformative practice offered in the teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji. It is a meditation that weaves together both scientific and mystical elements to help you enhance your consciousness and manifest your heartfelt intentions. The practice involves six gentle steps that guide you to silence the mind, calm the nervous system, slow down your thoughts, expand your awareness, merge all your energy into a state of unity, and then focus on your deepest desires for meaningful outcomes. It can be practiced at any time — when you wake up, after a day’s end, or whenever you feel the need to reconnect with your inner stillness. Through deep relaxation and expanded consciousness, Soul Sync helps you experience synchronicity and move toward your goals with greater clarity and peace. It is a way to align your inner world with the outer, so that your life flows with grace and purpose. Many who have taken this teaching into their daily lives — even those with very little material means — have found it to be a source of profound beauty and connection. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have shared, starting the day with Soul Sync meditation opens the door to a beautiful state. May this practice bring you closer to your own inner light. *(Teachings referenced: breath awareness, humming, golden light)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 06:43:37+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "deepseek-v4-flash:cloud", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": false, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc"], "model_provider": "ollama", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 9, "retrieval_queries": ["What is Soul Sync? (also: soul synchronization, breath meditation, breath awareness meditation) breath awareness humming pause breath awareness presence higher consciousness expanded awareness unity consciousness"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Q_CMuXKuvoU", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-0O6WmxU3pw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zO8tQkjCpyc"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 1956}	default
