1d719e42-418a-4d2f-a7a7-2fa9625f43ca	e07b7efc-a43d-43a2-8df7-abfa3f7a2b28	My dear friend, the Beautiful State is a state of being that is free from stress and filled with connection, joy, love, compassion, vitality, and passion. It is a state where you are fully present in the moment, unencumbered by the weight of past regrets or future anxieties. In this state, you are not controlled by obsessive, self-centric thinking, but instead, you are guided by a sense of inner truth and a deep connection to yourself and others. Imagine living a life where every moment is an opportunity to experience the beauty and wonder of existence, where every interaction is a chance to connect with others on a deeper level, and where every challenge is an invitation to grow and evolve. This is the Beautiful State, my friend. As Sri Preethaji teaches, the Beautiful State is not just a feeling or an emotion; it is a fundamental aspect of our true nature. It is a state that is available to us at all times, but it is often obscured by our thoughts, emotions, and experiences. The Beautiful State is a choice, a decision to let go of our attachment to stress and to instead choose connection, joy, and love. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZRQoiRe7s4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-07-06 10:17:58+00	{}	default
