1b723327-fc30-4390-80ee-13e3fdd63f39	bb6781d8-ad63-48d0-85ab-77f003305344	My dear seeker, I'm glad you asked about Ekam. Ekam is a Sanskrit word that Sri Krishnaji and Sri Preethaji often refer to in their teachings. It's a concept that represents the unity and interconnectedness of all things. Ekam is the state of being where we transcend our individual identities and merge with the universal consciousness. Imagine a drop of water merging with the ocean. The drop loses its individual identity and becomes one with the vastness of the ocean. This is Ekam – the state of being where we dissolve our boundaries and become one with the universe. In this state, we experience a sense of oneness, unity, and interconnectedness with all beings and all things. We see the world as a harmonious and interconnected web, where every action and every thought has an impact on the entire web. Sri Krishnaji and Sri Preethaji often speak about Ekam as a state of being that we can experience in our daily lives. It's a state of consciousness that allows us to see the world with fresh eyes, to experience life with wonder and awe, and to live in harmony with all beings. Watch more here: [Ekam Co Creator Mukti Guru Sri Krishnaji Exclusive | Frankly Speaking With Navika Kumar]\n\n*(Teachings referenced: world centre for enlightenment)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 10:29:46+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 8, "retrieval_queries": ["What is Ekam? (also: ekam world, world centre for enlightenment, world center for enlightenment) varadaiahpalem tirupati andhra pradesh higher consciousness expanded awareness unity consciousness"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZXuNv0L8YA", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 1435}	default
