7b036b3f-5929-4cc4-bb22-a6583cf3a84d	89947842-493f-427c-9f8b-0bbfb7fe230b	My dear seeker, I'm glad you asked about Ekam. Ekam is a Sanskrit word that Sri Krishnaji and Sri Preethaji often refer to in their teachings. It's a concept that represents the unity and interconnectedness of all things. Ekam is the state of being where we transcend our individual identities and merge with the universal consciousness. Imagine a drop of water merging with the ocean. The drop loses its individual identity and becomes one with the vastness of the ocean. This is Ekam – the state of being where we dissolve our boundaries and become one with the universe. In this state, we experience a sense of oneness, unity, and interconnectedness with all beings and all things. We see the world as a harmonious and interconnected web, where every action and every thought has an impact on the entire web. Sri Krishnaji and Sri Preethaji often speak about Ekam as a state of being that we can experience in our daily lives. It's a state of consciousness that allows us to see the world with fresh eyes, to experience life with wonder and awe, and to live in harmony with all beings. Watch more here: [Ekam Co Creator Mukti Guru Sri Krishnaji Exclusive | Frankly Speaking With Navika Kumar]\n\n*(Teachings referenced: world centre for enlightenment)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-07-06 10:34:20+00	{}	default
a899db82-572c-4d8c-8bcb-a2fd42dac792	0b8a40a6-5cf3-490d-8c21-f759b91829ed	My dear friend, the Beautiful State is a state of being that is free from stress, where life feels effortless and joyful. It is a state of connection, love, compassion, vitality, and passion. When we live in the Beautiful State, we are not preoccupied with ourselves, our past, or our future. We are fully present in the moment, and our actions are guided by a sense of inner truth and purpose. As Sri Preethaji teaches, the Beautiful State is the opposite of the stressful state, which is characterized by anger, fear, hurt, loneliness, and frustration. The stressful state is a state of self-centric thinking, where we are lost in our own thoughts and emotions, and we separate ourselves from others. The Beautiful State is not just a feeling or an emotion; it is a state of being that can be cultivated and experienced in our daily lives. It is a state of inner peace, calmness, and clarity, where we are able to respond to life's challenges with ease and wisdom. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZRQoiRe7s4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 10:34:39+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZRQoiRe7s4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 8, "retrieval_queries": ["What is the Beautiful State? (also: blissful state, state of bliss, state of calm, state of joy) calm joy love"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZRQoiRe7s4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw", "https