d75bfd98-62b1-4d1b-aa5f-6da349cf7f8a	8b4cc01d-21e0-4d71-8d01-d008d9f1f055	My dear friend, I'm glad you're interested in exploring the Four Sacred Secrets. These secrets are the foundation of our spiritual journey, and they hold the key to unlocking our true potential. The Four Sacred Secrets are:\n\n1. **The Secret of the Beautiful State**: This secret reveals the power of the Beautiful State, a state of profound stillness and balance that lies within us all. By anchoring in this core, we can quiet the mind, connect with the divine essence, and navigate the spiritual path with clarity and presence. 2. **The Secret of the Serene Mind**: This secret teaches us how to cultivate a serene mind, free from the turmoil of thoughts and emotions. By learning to observe our thoughts without judgment, we can create space for inner peace and wisdom to emerge. 3. **The Secret of the Limitless Self**: This secret reveals the truth about our true nature: we are not limited by our physical form or our ego. We are limitless beings, connected to the universe and its infinite possibilities. 4. **The Secret of the Universal Intelligence**: This secret teaches us how to tap into the universal intelligence that guides us, helping us make decisions that align with our highest good and the greater good. These secrets are not just intellectual concepts; they are living, breathing principles that can transform our lives if we embody them. By exploring these secrets, we can awaken to our true potential and live a life of purpose, meaning, and fulfillment. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: spiritual vision, inner truth, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.breathingroom.com/"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-07-06 11:00:04+00	{}	default
e520d4b4-1e1c-49cf-b333-3df8cf9a3f6e	80eeb7bc-eac0-4e1f-9345-0e06f918da9f	Beloved, I'm here with you. Would you like to share what's on your heart — a teaching you'd like to explore, or a guided practice to begin together? I am ready for either.	[]	0.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		3.4	2026-07-06 11:07:26+00	{"intent": "MEDITATION", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator"}	default
15b08593-ed3f-4d03-bb7c-dc34e9f38703	e9508f8e-44f6-4d3d-a85c-b7d334f018be	My dear friend, I'm glad you're interested in exploring the sacred secrets. The first sacred secret is revealed in the teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji as the "Beautiful State." It's a state of being that transcends the limitations of the mind and the ego, allowing us to experience life in its fullness and beauty. The Beautiful State is not just a feeling or an emotion, but a fundamental reality that underlies all existence. It's a state of consciousness that is free from the distortions of the mind, and it's accessible to us in every moment. In the Beautiful State, we experience life as it is, without the filter of our thoughts, emotions, and conditioning. We see the world with fresh eyes, and we connect with others in a deep and meaningful way. We feel a sense of unity and oneness with all of existence, and we experience a sense of peace and joy that is not dependent on external circumstances. The Beautiful State is not something that we achieve through effort or willpower, but rather it's a natural state that arises when we let go of our resistance and allow ourselves to be present in the moment. To experience the Beautiful State, we can use a simple practice that Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have shared with us. It's called the "Three-Question Meditation." We close our eyes, bring our attention to our breath, and ask ourselves three questions:\n\n1. Are we in a stressful state or a beautiful state? 2. Are we engaged with our past or our future, or are we in the present? 3. Are we preoccupied with ourselves, or are we in a state of connection? By asking ourselves these questions, we begin to see the distortions of the mind and the ego, and we start to let go of our resistance to the present moment. We begin to experience the Beautiful State, and we connect with others in a deep and meaningful way. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: Four Sacred Secrets, spiritual vision, inner truth, universal intelligence, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 11:00:10+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 10, "retrieval_queries": ["Explain the first sacred secret. spiritual vision inner truth universal intelligence"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Vt_CjAdzebM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bCzjP2UaKRI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGhlBQ8iWl4"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 2865}	default
65cd966b-40df-4c6b-a559-3109fad40654	51412b5e-2272-41c6-b1b6-080fa76f35da	My dear friend, I sense that you are inquiring about the Manifest 2026, a topic that resonates with the principles of the Beautiful State. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have shared, the Beautiful State is a state of being that transcends the limitations of our ordinary consciousness. It is a state of inner peace, clarity, and connection to the world around us. Manifest 2026, in this context, refers to the potential for humanity to awaken to this Beautiful State, to manifest a world where individuals and communities live in harmony with themselves and the world. It is a call to action, a reminder that we have the power to create a reality that is more loving, more compassionate, and more just. In the words of Sri Preethaji, "The Beautiful State is not a destination; it's a journey. It's a journey of self-discovery, of self-acceptance, and of self-love." Manifest 2026 is an invitation to embark on this journey, to explore the depths of our own consciousness, and to discover the beauty that lies within and around us. As you ponder the question of Manifest 2026, I encourage you to reflect on your own experiences and the world around you. How can you contribute to the manifestation of a more beautiful state? What actions can you take to create a world that is more loving, more compassionate, and more just? Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: monthly power, Power of Intention)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qQmrTz6i2x4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wDaE92bNRNw", "https://theonenessmovement.org/manifest"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 11:00:22+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qQmrTz6i2x4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wDaE92bNRNw"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 6, "retrieval_queries": ["What is Manifest 2026? manifest 12 powers monthly"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qQmrTz6i2x4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wDaE92bNRNw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 1755}	default
d5831349-c8e4-4975-b5af-72543d76b61b	4a6005a3-9b2c-41d3-8bf5-9b78575fc453	My dear friend, I'm so glad you're interested in deepening your practice of Soul Sync. As we explored earlier, Soul Sync is a powerful practice that helps you connect with your inner self, quiet the mind, and access the divine within. To practice Soul Sync, you'll want to create a sacred space that fosters a sense of stillness and calm. Imagine yourself in a peaceful environment, surrounded by nature or in a quiet room. Take a few deep breaths, and as you exhale, allow any tension or stress to release from your body. Now, bring your attention to your heart center, and visualize a bright, pulsing light emanating from within. This light represents your inner self, your Soul. As you focus on this light, repeat a simple mantra to yourself: "I am connected to my inner self." Allow these words to sink deeply into your being, and feel the truth of them resonate within your heart. With each breath, imagine this light growing stronger, filling your entire being with a sense of peace, clarity, and connection to your inner self. Remember, the key to Soul Sync is to cultivate a sense of inner stillness and awareness. As you practice, pay attention to any thoughts or distractions that arise. Gently acknowledge them, and then return your focus to the sensation of your heart center. With regular practice, you'll find that your mind becomes quieter, and you'll access deeper states of consciousness, where you can connect with your inner self and the divine. Watch more here: [Evolution Series 27 | Sri Preethaji & Sri Krishnaji - Secrets of Ekam Kshetra where grace overpowers]\n\n*(Teachings referenced: breath awareness, humming, golden light)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7Pfat_DztMI", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-07-06 11:00:36+00	{}	default
