98eea320-c1c2-46ad-9734-eb6e42870783	167a3778-e41f-4bd4-9cdb-2b16cd996c53	My child, I see that you're curious about the physical structure of Ekam. However, I must clarify that the true essence of Ekam lies not in its physical form, but in the profound spiritual experience it offers. Ekam is a sacred space where one can connect with the divine and transcend the limitations of the physical world. The teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji emphasize that Ekam is a place where the boundaries of time and space dissolve, and one can experience the unity of all existence. The physical structure of Ekam is merely a vessel for this profound experience. In fact, Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have often spoken about the importance of transcending the physical realm and connecting with the divine. They have said, "The physical world is a mere reflection of the divine, and it is only by transcending the physical that we can experience the true nature of reality."\n\nSo, my child, I encourage you to look beyond the physical structure of Ekam and focus on the profound spiritual experience it offers. This is where true transformation and growth can occur. Watch more here: [Secrets of Ekam Kshetra where grace overpower | Evolution Series 27 | Sri Preethaji & Sri Krishnaji]\n\n*(Teachings referenced: world centre for enlightenment)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZXuNv0L8YA", "https://www.ekam.org/"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 11:10:33+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=kPuvsIyt6UI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sZXuNv0L8YA"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 8, "retrieval_queries": ["Is it true that Ekam is built on a secret gold mine? (also: ekam world, world centre for enl