f1fb82b6-ce65-437b-98fb-9490cf62680d	9ff64c48-0c79-46e2-a2de-6c8481b5ad3d	My dear friend, I'm glad you're interested in exploring the Four Sacred Secrets. These secrets are the foundation of our spiritual journey, and they hold the key to unlocking our true potential. The Four Sacred Secrets are:\n\n1. **The Secret of the Beautiful State**: This secret reveals the power of the Beautiful State, a state of profound stillness and balance that lies within us all. By anchoring in this core, we can quiet the mind, connect with the divine essence, and navigate the spiritual path with clarity and presence. 2. **The Secret of the Serene Mind**: This secret teaches us how to cultivate a serene mind, free from the turmoil of thoughts and emotions. By learning to observe our thoughts without judgment, we can create space for inner peace and wisdom to emerge. 3. **The Secret of the Limitless Self**: This secret reveals the truth about our true nature: we are not limited by our physical form or our ego. We are limitless beings, connected to the universe and its infinite possibilities. 4. **The Secret of the Universal Intelligence**: This secret teaches us how to tap into the universal intelligence that guides us, helping us make decisions that align with our highest good and the greater good. These secrets are not just intellectual concepts; they are living, breathing principles that can transform our lives if we embody them. By exploring these secrets, we can awaken to our true potential and live a life of purpose, meaning, and fulfillment. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: spiritual vision, inner truth, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.breathingroom.com/"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-07-06 11:10:45+00	{}	default
2e0e6ceb-265f-4d5c-845e-0301161a439b	72c28dc1-3efa-4bff-8174-3c0b3a5396c5	My dear seeker, I'm glad you're continuing to explore the depths of Inner Truth. The second secret, as revealed by Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji, is about the power of "An" – the state of being before definition. This concept is the bridge between the abstract and the concrete, and it's the foundation of our true nature. In the state of "An," we transcend the limitations of our physical form and connect with our inner awareness. We become aware of our true essence, which is not bound by the constraints of the external world. This awareness empowers us to choose our response, grounding us in the present moment. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have taught, "An" is humble, simple, and foundational. It's the state of being that allows us to see beyond the surface level and connect with the deeper truth of our existence. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: spiritual vision, universal intelligence, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 11:11:02+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 7, "retrieval_queries": ["What is the second secret about Inner Truth?"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 1427}	default
