d0fea538-f156-4b89-ab9d-5c6cea5fbc00	5543d543-21e4-433f-a4c9-9efe9a0a75fe	My dear friend, the Beautiful State is a state of being that is free from stress, where life feels effortless and joyful. It is a state of connection, love, compassion, vitality, and passion. When we live in the Beautiful State, we are not preoccupied with ourselves, our past, or our future. We are fully present in the moment, and our actions are guided by a sense of inner truth and purpose. As Sri Preethaji teaches, the Beautiful State is the opposite of the stressful state, which is characterized by anger, fear, hurt, loneliness, and frustration. The stressful state is a state of self-centric thinking, where we are lost in our own thoughts and emotions, and we separate ourselves from others. The Beautiful State is not just a feeling or an emotion; it is a state of being that can be cultivated and experienced in our daily lives. It is a state of inner peace, calmness, and clarity, where we are able to respond to life's challenges with ease and wisdom. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZRQoiRe7s4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-07-06 11:25:07+00	{}	default
