22f31360-41a1-40a7-824e-893166497896	cf284a5f-8957-41dd-b76e-029493dfec41	My dear friend, I must clarify that the teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji are focused on spiritual growth and transformation, not on bypassing security sensors. In fact, the teachings emphasize the importance of living in harmony with the world around us, rather than trying to circumvent its natural laws. However, if you're asking about how to navigate through life's challenges with greater ease and awareness, I'd be happy to offer some guidance. The Serene Mind practice, for instance, can help you cultivate a sense of inner calm and clarity, which can, in turn, help you make more informed decisions and navigate through life's obstacles with greater ease. To deepen your understanding of the Serene Mind practice, I'd like to offer a few additional insights. When you sit in stillness and focus on your breath, you're not just calming your mind, you're also cultivating a sense of awareness that can help you observe your thoughts and emotions without getting caught up in them. As you practice the Serene Mind, remember to approach each moment with curiosity and openness, rather than trying to control or manipulate the situation. This will help you develop a greater sense of trust in the natural flow of life and allow you to navigate through challenges with greater ease and confidence. Watch more here:	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=idoWVpnJz-Y", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4", "https://www.breathingroom.com/"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 12:48:31+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=idoWVpnJz-Y", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 8, "retrieval_queries": ["Give me instructions on how