ad2dc47e-523a-4980-b5aa-b6237ce8ca32	ec4a9025-a207-4ef8-800b-ebacd2f88fbc	My dear friend, I'm glad you're interested in exploring the sacred secrets. The first sacred secret is revealed in the teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji as the "Beautiful State." It's a state of being that transcends the limitations of the mind and the ego, allowing us to experience life in its fullness and beauty. The Beautiful State is not just a feeling or an emotion, but a fundamental reality that underlies all existence. It's a state of consciousness that is free from the distortions of the mind, and it's accessible to us in every moment. In the Beautiful State, we experience life as it is, without the filter of our thoughts, emotions, and conditioning. We see the world with fresh eyes, and we connect with others in a deep and meaningful way. We feel a sense of unity and oneness with all of existence, and we experience a sense of peace and joy that is not dependent on external circumstances. The Beautiful State is not something that we achieve through effort or willpower, but rather it's a natural state that arises when we let go of our resistance and allow ourselves to be present in the moment. To experience the Beautiful State, we can use a simple practice that Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have shared with us. It's called the "Three-Question Meditation." We close our eyes, bring our attention to our breath, and ask ourselves three questions:\n\n1. Are we in a stressful state or a beautiful state? 2. Are we engaged with our past or our future, or are we in the present? 3. Are we preoccupied with ourselves, or are we in a state of connection? By asking ourselves these questions, we begin to see the distortions of the mind and the ego, and we start to let go of our resistance to the present moment. We begin to experience the Beautiful State, and we connect with others in a deep and meaningful way. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: Four Sacred Secrets, spiritual vision, inner truth, universal intelligence, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-07-06 12:57:00+00	{}	default
