ion, inner truth, universal intelligence, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-07-06 12:58:15+00	{}	default
