1b0a3658-f93d-4891-9a9b-ca26cdf07038	e35f6454-4e55-4aa9-af93-62c8e0b6bc73	My dear friend, I'm glad you asked about the Soul Sync. Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have shared that a Soul Sync is not a one-time event, but rather a continuous process of aligning our inner and outer worlds. The length of a Soul Sync can vary greatly, as it depends on the individual's level of awareness, willingness to let go, and commitment to their inner journey. Imagine a river flowing smoothly, with occasional rocks and eddies that create ripples. The Soul Sync is like the river's flow, where we navigate through the twists and turns of life, and sometimes, we encounter obstacles that require us to pause and adjust our course. The length of the pause or the depth of the eddy can vary, but the river's flow remains constant. In this sense, a typical Soul Sync can take anywhere from a few minutes to several hours, days, or even weeks. It's a dynamic process that unfolds as we surrender to the present moment and allow ourselves to be guided by our inner wisdom. As Sri Preethaji often says, "The Soul Sync is not a destination; it's a journey of becoming aware of our inner and outer worlds and aligning them in harmony." So, my friend, I encourage you to approach the Soul Sync with patience, compassion, and an open heart, knowing that the journey itself is the destination. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: breath awareness, humming, golden light)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zO8tQkjCpyc", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 13:12:02+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zO8tQkjCpyc"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 10, "retrieval_queries": ["How long does a typical Soul Sync take? (also: soul sy