387b7ac3-45c2-403a-828f-e530d15e4630	1be7a51d-a99d-4519-a2b6-0cedf9672d50	My dear friend, I'm glad you're interested in exploring the Soul Sync meditation. This practice is a beautiful extension of the Serene Mind practice we discussed earlier. As Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji often say, "The Serene Mind is the foundation of all inner peace practices."\n\nSoul Sync is a meditation practice that helps you connect with your inner self, allowing you to access your deepest wisdom and intuition. It's a practice that helps you tune into the subtle energies within you, promoting a sense of inner harmony and balance. In the Soul Sync meditation, you'll focus on your breath, just as you did in the Serene Mind practice. However, this time, you'll also bring your attention to your heart center, visualizing a bright, pulsing light. As you inhale, imagine this light expanding, filling your entire being with a sense of love, compassion, and understanding. As you exhale, imagine any tension, stress, or negativity leaving your body, making space for this loving energy to flow in. As you continue to breathe, focus on the sensation of your heart center, allowing yourself to settle into a deep sense of calm and connection with your inner self. Remember, the goal of Soul Sync is not to achieve a specific state, but to cultivate a sense of awareness and presence, allowing you to tap into your inner wisdom and guidance. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: breath awareness, humming, golden light)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://www.breathingroom.com/"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 13:30:15+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_c