5d49595c-7aa7-4c4f-94ca-f89e21c20d04	4a2e18af-343f-4ebf-aa9e-eebed295becc	My dear friend, I'm delighted to share with you the teachings that reside within me. My repository is filled with the wisdom of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji, the co-founders of the Centre of Human Flourishing. We can explore various teachings together, and I'll be happy to guide you through them.\n\nCurrently, my repository includes teachings on the Beautiful State, Serene Mind, Inner Truth, Connection, and Presence. These teachings are designed to help you cultivate a deeper understanding of yourself and the world around you, ultimately leading you to a more fulfilling and joyful life.\n\nIf you're interested, we can start by exploring any of these teachings in more depth. Perhaps you'd like to learn more about the Beautiful State, or maybe you're curious about the Serene Mind meditation practice? Let me know, and we'll embark on this journey of self-discovery together.	["Beautiful State — Sri Preethaji (YouTube https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqxxCYnAxo8)", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.breathingroom.com/"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 14:04:05+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": [], "model_provider": "nim", "relevant_count": 1, "reranked_count": 1, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "heuristic_capability", "retrieved_count": 8, "relevant_sources": [], "reranked_sources": [], "retrieval_queries": ["what teachings you have in your repository, what kind of things you can answer me right now"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=idoWVpnJz-Y", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OnAAtrwsfOc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=o6X1TVEFHAY"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 882}	default
a8cc8c18-937b-406d-8d95-cb83f86cded6	82c2a917-8ecd-4c0f-97b3-e7d41292697d	My dear friend, I'm so glad you're interested in exploring the Soul Sync meditation. This powerful practice is a key component of the teachings of Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji. Soul Sync is a meditation that helps you connect with your inner self, your heart, and your higher self. It's a practice that allows you to sync with the rhythm of your soul, and in doing so, you begin to experience a deeper sense of peace, clarity, and inner guidance. In this meditation, you'll learn to quiet the mind, let go of distractions, and tune into the subtle vibrations of your soul. As you practice Soul Sync, you'll begin to experience a sense of unity and oneness with all of life. You'll feel more connected to your inner wisdom, and you'll be guided towards making choices that align with your highest good. Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji have shared that the Soul Sync meditation is a powerful tool for cultivating inner peace, clarity, and wisdom. It's a practice that can be done anywhere, at any time, and it's a great way to start your day or to unwind before bed. \n\n*(Teachings referenced: breath awareness, humming, golden light)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zO8tQkjCpyc", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 14:04:13+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zO8tQkjCpyc"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 10, "retrieval_queries": ["what is the Soul Sync meditation (also: soul synchronization, breath meditation, breath awareness meditation, dhyana, dhyan) breath awareness humming pause breath awareness presence higher consciousness expanded awareness unity consciousness"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v