57c79849-4563-444e-8c8d-2df8b87c3b03	ab068bea-4935-49b0-a83b-86344ada1c58	My dear friend, let me simplify it for you. The Beautiful State is a way of living where you feel free from stress and filled with love, joy, and connection. It's being fully present in the moment, without worries about the past or future. Imagine living a life where every moment is a chance to experience beauty, every interaction is a chance to connect with others, and every challenge is an opportunity to grow. Think of it like this: when you're in a stressful state, you're like a boat in a stormy sea, tossed around by your thoughts and emotions. But when you're in the Beautiful State, you're like a calm lake on a peaceful day, reflecting the beauty of the world around you. The Beautiful State is not just a feeling, but a fundamental part of who you are. It's a choice to let go of stress and choose love, joy, and connection instead. *(Teachings referenced: Four Sacred Secrets, spiritual vision, inner truth, universal intelligence, spiritual right action, state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*	["Beautiful State — Sri Preethaji (YouTube https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqxxCYnAxo8)", "unknown", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "unknown", "unknown"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 14:32:00+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI"], "model_provider": "nim", "relevant_count": 2, "reranked_count": 2, "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "heuristic_simple", "retrieved_count": 8, "relevant_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI"], "reranked_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI"], "retrieval_queries": ["Explain this in simpler terms: My dear friend, the Beautiful State is a state of being that is free from stress and filled with connection, joy, love, compassion, vitality, and passion. It is a state where you are fully present in the moment, unencumbered by the weight of past regrets or future anxieties. In this state, you are not controlled by obsessive, self-centric thinking, but instead, you are guided by a sense of inner truth and a deep connection to yourself and others. Imagine living a life where every moment is an opportunity to experience the beauty and wonder of existence, where every interaction is a chance to connect with others on a deeper level, and where every challenge is an invitation to grow and evolve. This is the Beautiful State, my friend. As Sri Preethaji teaches, the Beautiful State is not just a feeling or an emotion; it is a fundamental aspect of our true nature. It is a state that is available to us at all times, but it is often obscured by our thoughts, emotions, and experiences. The Beautiful State is a choice, a decision to let go of our attachment to stress and to instead choose connection, joy, and love. Watch more here: *(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=U23yKxWbIcI", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 1156}	default
