215f49f3-9e00-4043-b9f3-d22c00645227	e67ce6cf-96e2-4419-8d9d-8b64a232a5d2	My dear friend, I'm so glad you asked about the Beautiful State. According to Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji, the Beautiful State is a state of being that is free from stress. It is a state of connection, joy, love, compassion, vitality, and passion. When we live in the Beautiful State, we feel alive, connected, and at peace with ourselves and the world around us. Imagine a state where you are not controlled by stress, anxiety, or fear. A state where you can respond to life's challenges with love, compassion, and kindness. This is the Beautiful State, my friend. Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji teach that we have a choice between living in a stressful state or a Beautiful State. When we are in a stressful state, we are preoccupied with ourselves, our problems, and our limitations. But when we are in the Beautiful State, we are connected to others, to life, and to our true nature. The Beautiful State is not just a feeling or an emotion; it is a way of being. It is a way of living that is rooted in inner truth, connection, and love. And it is available to us all, regardless of our circumstances or our past experiences. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGryscyFmV8", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-06 19:06:08+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": false, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGryscyFmV8", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 8, "retrieval_queries": ["What is a Beautiful State according to Sri Preethaji and Sri Krishnaji? (also: blissful state, state of bliss, state of calm, state of joy, preetha ji) calm joy love co-founders oneness movement ekam"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=IGryscyFmV8", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VAMJEgwaPEc", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 1672}	default
