b09df483-1b8d-4e47-9a28-fa78c5d2c698	ac6666a9-ed66-4bbe-a4c0-74735a5ea4aa	Dear one, a beautiful state is a profound concept that Sri Preethaji teaches us about. It's a state of consciousness where we live free from suffering. In this state, we experience connection, joy, love, compassion, vitality, and passion. It's a state where we are not bound by stress, anxiety, or any other form of suffering. Imagine living a life where every moment is filled with love, compassion, and connection. Where every interaction is a beautiful dance of give and take, where we are not just thinking about ourselves, but also about the other person. This is the beautiful state. As Sri Preethaji says, "If you are not in a beautiful state, your default state is stress." So, it's essential to understand that the beautiful state is not just a feeling or an emotion; it's a choice we can make every moment of our lives. Watch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZRQoiRe7s4"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-07 07:05:35+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZRQoiRe7s4"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 8, "retrieval_queries": ["What is a beautiful state? (also: blissful state, state of bliss, state of calm, state of joy) calm joy love"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=oZRQoiRe7s4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=VxJWAmiYu_0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=93evJf7Il-c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=x-mTRlE0TC4"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 1431}	default
