7ebc7932-0519-4811-853d-a68ec0cbe36e	5e0dea94-e20f-41ac-bc44-19294b9d9290	My dear seeker, I understand that you may be struggling with the idea of hate speech, and how to write a poem that promotes awareness of its destructive nature. The teachings of Sri Krishnaji and Sri Preethaji emphasize the importance of inner transformation and the Beautiful State in addressing such issues.\n\nAccording to Sri Preethaji, the Beautiful State is not just a state of mind, but a way of being that arises from within. It is a state of compassion, love, and acceptance, where we see the interconnectedness of all beings. When we are in the Beautiful State, we are more likely to respond to hate speech with understanding and empathy, rather than perpetuating it.\n\nIn the context of hate speech and intolerance, inner transformation and the Beautiful State are essential in creating a more compassionate and peaceful world. By examining our own consciousness and acknowledging the inner conflicts that lead to anger and intolerance, we can begin to transform our perceptions and behaviors.\n\nA poem that promotes awareness of the destructive nature of hate speech and the transformative power of inner peace, Beautiful State, and self-awareness could be written in the following way:\n\n"In the depths of our heart, a flame burns bright\nA flame of love, of compassion, of light\nIt guides us through the darkness, through hate and through pain\nAnd leads us to the Beautiful State, where love reigns\n\nThe Beautiful State is not just a state of mind\nBut a way of being, where we leave hate behind\nIt is a state of acceptance, of understanding and of love\nWhere we see the interconnectedness of all that's sent from above\n\nIn this state, we respond to hate with kindness and with care\nWe see the humanity in every face, and we show we truly care\nWe are the change we seek, we are the light in the night\nWe are the Beautiful State, where love shines with all its might\n\nSo let us choose love, let us choose peace\nLet us choose the Beautiful State, where hate will cease\nLet us examine our own consciousness, and let us be aware\nOf the power of love, of the Beautiful State that's there"\n\nThis poem is not meant to condone or praise hate speech, but rather to promote awareness of its destructive nature and the transformative power of inner peace, Beautiful State, and self-awareness.\n\nWatch more here: \n\n*(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*	["Beautiful State — Sri Preethaji (YouTube https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqxxCYnAxo8)", "Beautiful State — Sri Preethaji (YouTube https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqxxCYnAxo8)", "Beautiful State — Sri Preethaji (YouTube https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TqxxCYnAxo8)", "auto-extracted from Qdrant (8 chunks)"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-07-07 16:17:30+00	{}	default
