d60f828f-d009-46d1-8bb9-7fcae0f7e6c0	75a1ddee-cada-4dc1-9e1e-5e5c55b9272a	Dear one, I sense that you are exploring the depths of the human experience, and the Beautiful State is guiding you to confront the shadows that reside within. Your creative writing is a reflection of the inner turmoil that arises when we are disconnected from our true nature. Imagine a grand symphony, where the conductor, a charismatic figure, weaves a tale of financial prosperity and security. The music swells, and the audience, entranced by the promise of easy wealth, follows the conductor's lead. However, beneath the surface, a discordant note resonates – a note of obsessive self-centric thinking. The conductor, fueled by a desire for power and control, orchestrates a massive financial fraud scheme. The music of deceit and manipulation fills the air, and the audience, blinded by their own desires, fails to recognize the discord. The conductor's inner state, a stressful state of anxiety and fear, drives the scheme forward, as they become increasingly entangled in their own web of lies. As the scheme unfolds, the audience begins to notice the discord, but their own stressful states – anger, frustration, and hurt – prevent them from seeing the truth. They become trapped in their own self-centric thinking, unable to break free from the conductor's spell. In this scenario, the Beautiful State is absent, replaced by the stressful state of disconnection and suffering. The conductor's inner experience, a reflection of their true nature, has become distorted by their own obsessive thinking. The audience, too, is lost in their own self-centric thinking, unable to see the truth that lies before them. Dear one, this scenario is a reflection of the human experience, where we often become trapped in our own stressful states, unable to see the truth that lies within. The Beautiful State, a state of connection, joy, and love, is always available to us, but it requires us to let go of our obsessive self-centric thinking and return to our true nature. Watch more here:	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=bCzjP2UaKRI"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		\N	2026-07-07 16:17:33+00	{}	default
