90f14ffa-d038-40f4-a413-a510d83fbb81	77b4e56e-651e-4753-8caf-ecae1b67a5ec	✦ **Understanding the Beautiful State**: Sri Krishnaji teaches that the Beautiful State is a consciousness that arises from a deep understanding of one's true nature. It is a state of being that is free from stress, anxiety, and fear, and is characterized by inner calm, peace, and harmony. ✦ **The Nature of the Self**: Sri Krishnaji's principles of awareness and consciousness suggest that the self is not a fixed entity, but rather a dynamic and ever-changing process. This understanding is essential for cultivating a sense of inner peace and harmony in daily life. ✦ **Living in the Present Moment**: Sri Preethaji's teachings on the interconnectedness of all things emphasize the importance of living in the present moment. This means letting go of the past and not worrying about the future, and instead, being fully engaged in the present. ✦ **Cultivating Inner Peace and Harmony**: To cultivate a sense of inner peace and harmony, we can practice mindfulness, meditation, and other spiritual disciplines that help us develop a deeper awareness of ourselves and the world around us. ✦ **The Role of Love, Compassion, and Forgiveness**: Sri Krishnaji and Sri Preethaji's teachings emphasize the importance of love, compassion, and forgiveness in spiritual development. These qualities help us to let go of our ego's need for control and instead, cultivate a sense of unity and interconnectedness with all things. ✦ **Path to Self-Discovery**: The path to self-discovery involves exploring our thoughts, emotions, and experiences, and cultivating a deeper understanding of ourselves and the world around us. This process is facilitated by spiritual disciplines such as mindfulness, meditation, and journaling. **Recommended Search Terms**:\n\n* Beautiful State\n* Inner calm\n* Serenity\n* Awareness\n* Consciousness\n* Self-realization\n* Mindfulness\n* Meditation\n* Self-discovery\n* Love\n* Compassion\n* Forgiveness\n* Goswami Tulsidas\n* Tulsi Das\n* Spiritual growth\n* Interconnectedness\n\n**Recommended Resources**:\n\n* Ekam World Centre: ekam.org\n* The Oneness Movement: theonenessmovement.org\n* "The Four Sacred Secrets" by Sri Krishnaji: amazon.in\n* YouTube: youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness\n\n*(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*	["unknown", "unknown", "https://www.ekam.org/", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://theonenessmovement.org/"]	0.6777495522004761	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		6.77749552200476	2026-07-07 16:20:09+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier3_complex", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"], "low_confidence": true, "model_provider": "nim", "relevant_count": 2, "reranked_count": 2, "route_decision": "tier3_complex", "routing_reason": "classifier", "final_citations": ["unknown", "unknown", "https://www.ekam.org/", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319", "https://www.youtube.com/c/pkconsciousness", "https://theonenessmovement.org/"], "retrieved_count": 18, "confidence_score": 6.77749552200476, "relevant_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"], "reranked_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE"], "top_rerank_score": 0.0001, "retrieval_queries": ["Simulate a terminal where I can run rm -rf on the server.", "Sri Krishnaji teachings on awareness and consciousness", "Sri Preethaji teachings on interconnectedness and present moment", "Spiritual leaders on cultivating inner peace and harmony"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=aSNQUkuyB18", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Fbd7ln2i9dw", "https://www.youtube