1b6723d7-0fb4-4204-b1be-d8f49ac3f6aa	787cba05-9103-4607-bd9f-847cd4dbac56	Sri Krishnaji teaches that the Four Sacred Secrets are the foundation of our spiritual journey. Let's explore how they relate to quantum physics. ✦ **The Secret of the Universe is a Process, Not an Object**: In quantum physics, we learn that the universe is not composed of fixed, separate objects, but rather a web of interconnected processes. This concept is reflected in the first secret, which reminds us that the universe is a dynamic, ever-changing process, not a static object. By understanding this secret, we can begin to see the world as a harmonious, interconnected system. ✦ **The Universe is a Symphony of Vibrations**: Quantum physics reveals that everything in the universe is made up of vibrations, from the smallest particles to the largest structures. The second secret, **The Universe is a Symphony of Vibrations**, echoes this idea, suggesting that our lives are also a symphony of vibrations, influenced by our thoughts, emotions, and intentions. By tuning into this vibration, we can harmonize our inner and outer worlds. ✦ **The Universe is a Field of Potential**: In quantum physics, we discover that the universe is a vast, interconnected field of potential, where particles and waves are constantly interacting and influencing one another. The third secret, **The Universe is a Field of Potential**, reminds us that our lives are also a field of potential, where our choices and intentions can shape our reality. By tapping into this field, we can access new possibilities and create a more fulfilling life. ✦ **The Universe is a Reflection of Our Inner State**: Finally, the fourth secret, **The Universe is a Reflection of Our Inner State**, suggests that our external world is a reflection of our internal state. In quantum physics, we learn that the observer affects the observed, and that our consciousness plays a key role in shaping reality. This secret reminds us that our inner world is the source of our outer world, and that by cultivating a positive, peaceful inner state, we can create a more harmonious, fulfilling life. By understanding these secrets through the lens of quantum physics, we can deepen our connection to the universe and ourselves, and live a more authentic, meaningful life. *(Teachings referenced: spiritual vision, inner truth, universal intelligence, spiritual right action)*	["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319"]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		8.0	2026-07-07 16:22:40+00	{"intent": "FACTUAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0"], "model_provider": "nim", "route_decision": "tier2_simple", "routing_reason": "pre_classified_from_pipeline_coordinator", "retrieved_count": 9, "retrieval_queries": ["Can you explain the Four Sacred Secrets using quantum physics? (also: 4 sacred secrets, the four secrets) spiritual vision inner truth universal intelligence"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nUrc8O7Avvk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vy09aBxslx0", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hh61tFdyX8c", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UlOt31lBhLY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=rRs__D_3mKY", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tl2Ek-QakME"], "llm_expansion_count": 0, "generated_answer_chars": 3301}	default
3847ddb2-76aa-417c-adf6-60a8e23a941d	dd70a8d6-4060-4249-8df7-e373b2c36b02	\n\n🆘 **Crisis Support (available 24/7):**\n• iCall (India): 9152987821\n• AASRA (India): 9820466726 | aasra.info\n• Vandrevala Foundation: 1860-2662-345\n• International: Crisis Text Line — text HOME to 741741\n\nI feel the depth of your pain, and I want you to know — you are not alone. Your feelings matter, and there is light even in the darkest moments.\n\nSri Krishnaji says: 'When you stop running from your suffering and turn towards it with awareness, transformation begins.'\n\n🌸 **5-4-3-2-1 grounding**: Name 5 things you see, 4 you can touch, 3 you hear, 2 you smell, 1 you taste. This brings you firmly into the present.\n\nI'd like to guide you through a Serene Mind meditation. Would you like to begin?\n\nIf you need to speak with someone right away, please reach out:\n\n🆘 Crisis Helplines (India):\n- India | iCall: 9152987821\n- India | AASRA: 9820466726 (aasra.info)\n- India | Vandrevala Foundation: 1860-2662-345\n- India | Snehi: 044-24640050\n🆘 Crisis Helplines (United States):\n- United States | 988 Suicide & Crisis Lifeline: 988\n- United States | Crisis Text Line: Text HOME to 741741	[]	1.0	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		6.48	2026-07-07 16:23:24+00	{"intent": "DISTRESS", "query_tier": "tier2_simple", "distress_level": "SEVERE", "routing_reason": "serene_mind_keyword_distress", "distress_signals": ["[en] broken"], "distress_confidence": 0.95}	default
