tual Action] By following these practices, we can transition into a beautiful state of inner peace and live a life that's filled with connection, co", "doc_id": "unknown", "source": "Retrieved document", "confidence": 0.187, "span_in_answer": "[Source: The Serene Mind: Moving into Calm and Spiritual Action] By following these practices, we can transition into a beautiful state of inner peace and live a life that's filled with connection, compassion, and understanding."}, {"quote": "[Source: The Serene Mind: Moving into Calm and Spiritual Action] *(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*", "doc_id": "unknown", "source": "Retrieved document", "confidence": 0.159, "span_in_answer": "[Source: The Serene Mind: Moving into Calm and Spiritual Action] *(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*"}]	0.6329658513952808	1.0	1.0	1.0	f		6.11	2026-07-07 16:52:09+00	{"intent": "RELATIONAL", "model_used": "meta/llama-3.1-8b-instruct", "query_tier": null, "memory_used": true, "citation_urls": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw"], "model_provider": "nim", "relevant_count": 1, "reranked_count": 1, "route_decision": "standard", "routing_reason": "classifier", "retrieved_count": 10, "relevant_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw"], "reranked_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=sCiK7ABPcrw"], "retrieval_queries": ["How does suffering relate to the ego, and how can we transition into a beautiful state of inner peace? (also: blissful state, state of bliss, state of calm, state of joy)", "suffering ego relationship teachings", "ego dissolution inner peace spiritual practices", "transitioning from ego to inner peace spiritual texts"], "retrieved_sources": ["https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nwQaU-agzFE", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=zGOKGrTNlk4", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=UgQV_5FjPNk", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=odXq5g-Y7gM", "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v