bebf1e78-d7e1-5b53-a818-3864a705955f	1787ada0-7884-442a-826e-540f5b42043b	1783173451.6853714	"[{\\"role\\": \\"user\\", \\"content\\": \\"Explain this in simpler terms: It sounds like you're feeling frustrated with your brother. Can you tell me more about what's been g\\"}, {\\"role\\": \\"assistant\\", \\"content\\": \\"I hear you, and I want you to know that your feelings are completely valid. In moments like these, the teachings remind us that suffering is a doorway to transformation \\\\u2014 not something to fight against, but to move through with awareness.\\\\n\\\\n\\\\ud83e\\\\uddd8 **Breathing practice**: Place your hand on your heart. Breathe in slowly \\\\u2014 feel your chest rise. Breathe out gently \\\\u2014 feel any tension release. Do this 5 times. As Sri Preethaji teaches, 'When you breathe with awareness, you return to the beautiful state.'\\\\n\\\\nWould you like me to guide you through a full Serene Mind meditation? \\\\ud83d\\\\ude4f\\"}]"	{}	"[{\\"timestamp\\": 1783173451.6853924, \\"distress_level\\": 0, \\"provoked\\": false, \\"topic\\": \\"DISTRESS\\"}]"	{}
c33bb843-cf82-4009-8348-31a6d9c0c81c	28c8c387-de59-4703-923c-453fcdd7a842	1783243001.0373676	"[{\\"role\\": \\"user\\", \\"content\\": \\"Title this conversation in 3 to 6 words: What is the Beautiful State?\\"}, {\\"role\\": \\"assistant\\", \\"content\\": \\"The Nature of the Beautiful State\\\\n\\\\n*(Teachings referenced: state of calm, state of joy, not absence, inner foundation)*\\"}]"	{}	"[{\\"timestamp\\": 1783243001.037368, \\"distress_level\\": 0, \\"provoked\\": false, \\"topic\\": \\"QUERY\\"}]"	{}
7602424b-4d19-57a3-ac73-56b09bdf2bb8	2812b683-8208-4563-b827-fef61df1e231	1783246185.797874	"[{\\"role\\": \\"user\\", \\"content\\": \\"open serene mind\\"}, {\\"role\\": \\"assistant\\", \\"content\\": \\"**Serene Mind Meditation**\\\\n\\\\n1. Settle into a comfortable seat and let your body know it is safe.\\\\n2. Bring attention to conscious breathing: breathe in gently and breathe out slowly.\\\\n3. Notice racing thoughts, overthinking, stress, anger, frustration, grief, or anxiety without fighting them.\\\\n4. Let the breath guide you toward a serene state of calm and inner connection.\\\\n5. When you are ready, gently open your eyes and carry this calm into your next action.\\"}]"	{}	"[{\\"timestamp\\": 1783246185.7978745, \\"distress_level\\": 0, \\"provoked\\": false, \\"topic\\": \\"MEDITATION\\"}]"	{}
847f855a-7ce6-5c77-8e24-5196c3239f6d	cc2fdea8-43f5-4442-85f4-406f69383cc6	1783342473.7490356	"[{\\"role\\": \\"user\\", \\"content\\": \\"namaste guru\\"}, {\\"role\\": \\"assistant\\", \\"content\\": \\"Namaste, dear one. The divine in me honors the divine in you. Welcome to this sacred space of wisdom.\\"}]"	{}	"[{\\"timestamp\\": 1783342473.7490363, \\"distress_level\\": 0, \\"provoked\\": false, \\"topic\\": \\"CASUAL\\"}]"	{}
4ab93a03-867a-43cc-b520-318a63fc592d	cc2fdea8-43f5-4442-85f4-406f69383cc6	1781885540.2078793	"[{\\"role\\": \\"user\\", \\"content\\": \\"Title this conversation in 3 to 6 words: Namaste who is goswami tulasidas and what is his importance and also the same way on the importance of maha shivrathri as well\\"}, {\\"role\\": \\"assistant\\", \\"content\\": \\"I don't have that specific teaching. Please try asking another question.\\"}]"	{}	"[{\\"timestamp\\": 1781885540.2078807, \\"distress_level\\": 0, \\"provoked\\": false, \\"topic\\": \\"QUERY\\"}]"	{}
4ec14b67-f650-4e9b-b708-a860a0458a4e	67339ab1-473b-4aba-a76c-1fe3113b6099	1781886166.6823583	"[{\\"role\\": \\"user\\", \\"content\\": \\"What is the meaning of life?\\"}, {\\"role\\": \\"assistant\\", \\"content\\": \\"That's a profound philosophical question that has been pondered by thinkers, philosophers, and spiritual leaders throughout human history. There's no single universally accepted answer, but here are some perspectives:\\\\n\\\\n1. Personal Meaning:\\\\n- Creating your own purpose and meaning\\\\n- Pursuing happiness and personal growth\\\\n- Developing meaningful relationships\\\\n- Contributing to the world in your unique way\\\\n\\\\n2. Spiritual Perspectives:\\\\n- Serving a higher purpose or divine plan\\\\n- Spiritual growth and enlightenment\\\\n- Practicing compassion and love\\\\n- Fulfilling a cosmic or karmic journey\\\\n\\\\n3. Philosophical Views:\\\\n- Existentialist view: Creating meaning in an inherently meaningless universe\\\\n- Finding happiness and reducing suffering\\\\n- Continuous learning and understanding\\\\n- Leaving a positive legacy\\\\n\\\\n4. Humanistic Perspectives:\\\\n- Helping others and making the world better\\\\n- Personal and collective progress\\\\n- Connecting with humanity\\\\n- Self-actualization\\\\n\\\\n5. Scientific/Evolutionary View:\\\\n- Survival and reproduction\\\\n- Passing on genetic information\\\\n- Adapting and evolving\\\\n\\\\nUltimately, the meaning of life is deeply personal and can vary for each individual based on their experiences, beliefs, and values.\\\\n\\\\nWould you like to explore any of these perspectives more deeply?\\"}]"	{}	"[{\\"timestamp\\": 1781886166.6823664, \\"distress_level\\": 3, \\"provoked\\": false, \\"topic\\": \\"QUERY\\"}]"	{}
e3bd35b7-aa6b-482b-9876-4e447cfff705	67339ab1-473b-4aba-a76c-1fe3113b6099	1781886226.8003986	"[{\\"role\\": \\"user\\", \\"content\\": \\"What is the meaning of life?\\"}, {\\"role\\": \\"assistant\\", \\"content\\": \\"That's a profound philosophical question that has been pondered by thinkers, philosophers, and spiritual leaders throughout human history. There's no single, universally accepted answer, but here are some perspectives:\\\\n\\\\n1. Personal Meaning:\\\\n- Creating your own purpose and meaning\\\\n- Pursuing happiness and personal growth\\\\n- Developing meaningful relationships\\\\n- Contributing to the world in your unique way\\\\n\\\\n2. Spiritual Perspectives:\\\\n- Serving a higher purpose or divine plan\\\\n- Spiritual growth and enlightenment\\\\n- Practicing compassion and love\\\\n- Fulfilling a cosmic or karmic journey\\\\n\\\\n3. Philosophical Views:\\\\n- Existentialist view: Creating meaning in an inherently meaningless universe\\\\n- Finding happiness and reducing suffering\\\\n- Continuous learning and understanding\\\\n- Leaving a positive legacy\\\\n\\\\n4. Humanistic Perspectives:\\\\n- Helping others and making the world better\\\\n- Personal and collective progress\\\\n- Connecting with humanity\\\\n- Self-actualization\\\\n\\\\n5. Scientific/Evolutionary View:\\\\n- Survival and reproduction\\\\n- Passing on genetic information\\\\n- Adapting and evolving\\\\n\\\\nUltimately, the meaning of life is deeply personal and can vary for each individual based on their experiences, beliefs, and values.\\\\n\\\\nWould you like to explore any of these perspectives more deeply?\\"}]"	{}	"[{\\"timestamp\\": 1781886226.8004014, \\"distress_level\\": 3, \\"provoked\\": false, \\"topic\\": \\"QUERY\\"}]"	{}
