0bb009c5-f5a1-5a91-905b-18341a50610f	9f55981a-9ba3-4dca-afda-d4a8d9763f34	1783400163.4202237	"[{\\"role\\": \\"user\\", \\"content\\": \\"Line 3: Three sacred secrets\\"}, {\\"role\\": \\"assistant\\", \\"content\\": \\"My dear one, you are now inquiring about the three sacred secrets as mentioned by Sri Krishnaji. This is a profound topic, and I'm happy to guide you deeper into its depths. The three sacred secrets, as Sri Krishnaji has shared, are the keys to unlocking the mysteries of the human experience. They are:\\\\n\\\\n1. The first secret is that the past is not what it seems. It is a story we tell ourselves, a narrative that shapes our perceptions and understanding of reality. By recognizing this, we can begin to see the past as a mere memory, a recollection of events that have passed, rather than a fixed and unchangeable reality.\\\\n2. The second secret is that the future is not what it seems. It is a projection of our desires, fears, and expectations, a mental construct that we use to navigate the unknown. By recognizing this, we can begin to see the future as a fluid and dynamic reality, rather than a fixed and predetermined outcome.\\\\n3. The third secret is that the present moment is the only reality. It is the only moment that truly exists, the only moment that is not bound by the constraints of time and space. By recognizing this, we can begin to see the present moment as the source of all creation, the source of all life and energy.\\\\n\\\\nAs Sri Krishnaji would say, \\\\\\"The present moment is the only reality. It is the only moment that truly exists. It is the source of all creation, the source of all life and energy.\\\\\\" By embracing this secret, we can begin to see the world in a new light, a world that is full of possibility and potential.\\\\n\\\\nWatch more here: *\\"}]"	{unknown,https://www.amazon.in/Four-Sacred-Secrets-Prosperity-Beautiful/dp/1846046319}	"[{\\"timestamp\\": 1783400163.4202268, \\"distress_level\\": 0, \\"provoked\\"